194002585e5a7c018a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T09:27:45Z","email":"unka.malloc@outlook.com","name":"Unka Y.Y."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T09:27:45Z","email":"unka.malloc@outlook.com","name":"Unka Y.Y."},"message":"Add docs archive, index updates, CI and ignore rules\n\nRegenerate and expand docs indexes and README guidance (many docs/ INDEX.md and README.md updates), add an archive area (docs/archive/*) with ARCHIVE-MANIFEST.json and ledger, and introduce rollups/current-state and history entry. Update docs maintenance rules to document generator and lifecycle/audit commands (python3 scripts/docs-index.py --write, docs-lifecycle.py, docs-audit.py).\n\nUpdate CI workflow (.github/workflows/repository-hygiene.yml) to check out sibling repos (Unka-Malloc/styio-nightly and Unka-Malloc/styio-spio) and run additional validation (ecosystem-cli-doc-gate.py) from the styio-view working directory alongside the existing hygiene script.\n\nExpand .gitignore to include IDE/editor dirs, virtualenvs, caches, temp/log patterns and add explicit negate rules to allow tracked docs/test build fixtures under docs/** and frontend test build paths.\n\nAdd frontend integration adapters, platform-specific adapter stubs, tests, and related adjustments to integration and app files (new adapter sources and tests added, several integration and app files modified). Add helper scripts for docs auditing/indexing/lifecycle and an ecosystem CLI doc gate script.","tree":{"sha":"bd72f51977ab8fa49e60e2228e85cb5356ecb7b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SymPolicy/Vityo/git/trees/bd72f51977ab8fa49e60e2228e85cb5356ecb7b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SymPolicy/Vityo/git/commits/47cbe193cb351d364818d194002585e5a7c018a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33834801?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unk