I traduzidos.\n\nDuas adaptações nos exemplos: `cpf: user.cpf` no bloco de \"nunca logue\nisso\" virou `taxId`, que faz o mesmo ponto sem depender de um documento\nbrasileiro; e o item de checklist sobre LGPD virou \"privacy/data\nprotection policy\", com LGPD/GDPR mantidos juntos onde o texto cita as\nduas regulações.\n\nEstrutura conferida: 60 cercas, 14 h2, 24 h3, 2 links internos e 8\nexternos — todos batendo.\n\nRefs: tradução 4/5\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"bc02f2089fc15ed29c3dd3ee30ede93a33dbd719","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/bc02f2089fc15ed29c3dd3ee30ede93a33dbd719"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/80ee1a10f2741d34eed1b6a3f9b8bb92a52377dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/80ee1a10f2741d34eed1b6a3f9b8bb92a52377dd","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7