te do artigo de code review, onde \"validação de CPF\" era\numa referência de passagem e virou \"document validation\" sem perder\nnada, neste artigo o CPF é o exemplo que atravessa o texto inteiro — tem\ncódigo, tem o caso extremo do 111.111.111-11, tem a API do toolkit.\nGenericizar quebraria o argumento e os blocos de código junto.\n\nRefs: tradução 3/5\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"3d2bfe16e54c015632ce56d9dcf9c09efdcb98c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/3d2bfe16e54c015632ce56d9dcf9c09efdcb98c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/7e492d59c1e8c4290f3c7fdcffebb6fd768d3b93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/7e492d59c1e8c4290f3c7fdcffebb6fd768d3b93","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDdlNDkyZDU5YzFlOGM0MjkwZjNjN2ZkY2ZmZWJiNmZkNzY4ZDNiOTM","parents":[{"html_ur