\".\n\nRefs: tradução 1/5\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"7ab74411c6c1558aa5a263c00d2137c56dd3a754","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/7ab74411c6c1558aa5a263c00d2137c56dd3a754"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/efdd26f9fe838f240af443669b8f05a103e57688","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/efdd26f9fe838f240af443669b8f05a103e57688","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGVmZGQyNmY5ZmU4MzhmMjQwYWY0NDM2NjliOGYwNWExMDNlNTc2ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/9f69f732b92114a021ef4b43e1f8e034070cb452","sha":"9f69f732b92114a021ef4b43e1f8e034070cb452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9f69f732b92114a021ef4b43e1f8e034070cb452"}],"sha":"efdd26f9fe838f240af443669b8f05a103e57688","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/efdd26f9fe838f240af443669b8f05a103e57688"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9f69f732b92114a021ef4b43e1f8e034070cb452/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T22:39:06Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T22:39:06Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(articles): update cross-article links to the new path routes\n\nOs links entre artigos ainda usavam `#/artigos/<slug>`, o formato de\nantes de A29. Com rota por caminho eles pararam de funcionar: clicar num\ndeles a partir de um artigo só acrescentava o fragmento à URL atual, o\n`parseRoute` continuava lendo o mesmo `pathname`, e o resultado era uma\ntentativa de rolar até um elemento com id \"/artigos/<slug>\" — ou seja,\nnada acontecia.\n\nO `redirectLegacyHash` cobre quem CHEGA por um link antigo, no boot, mas\nnão a navegação dentro do site.\n\n18 ocorrências em 6 arquivos.\n\nRefs: A29\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"02a61eb84b0ae2c133782fbad485e3bc413846af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/02a61eb84b0ae2c133782fbad485e3bc413846af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/9f69f732b92114a021ef4b43e1f8e034070cb452","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/9f69f732b92114a021ef4b43e1f8e034070cb452","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDlmNjlmNzMyYjkyMTE0YTAyMWVmNGI0M2UxZjhlMDM0MDcwY2I0NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/85a6a30058d195f5ab93f4bfd5ba287cb654a3b1","sha":"85a6a30058d195f5ab93f4bfd5ba287cb654a3b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/85a6a30058d195f5ab93f4bfd5ba287cb654a3b1"}],"sha":"9f69f732b92114a021ef4b43e1f8e034070cb452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9f69f732b92114a021ef4b43e1f8e034070cb452"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/85a6a30058d195f5ab93f4bfd5ba287cb654a3b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T22:32:12Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T22:32:12Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(theme): make the 3D layer follow the theme everywhere\n\nA seção Expertise continuava clara no modo escuro: título, descrição e\nos dois itens não destacados ficavam roxo-claro sobre lavanda.\n\nCausa: o fundo dessa seção é pintado pelo CANVAS, não pelo CSS, e a\n`TransactionFlow` tinha `SURFACE = 0xf6f3fc` fixo. O §4.4 do plano listou\nas features que mudam com o tema e esqueceu justamente essa — o §1.3\nregistrava que o canvas pinta o fundo ali, e eu não liguei os pontos.\n\nAo corrigir apareceu um segundo bug, do commit 81024f9:\n`observeTheme()` roda no construtor do `Experience`, mas as features\nentram depois, por `add()`. O `setTheme` inicial percorria uma lista\nvazia, então abrir a página já no escuro deixava as cenas com cor de\ntema claro até a primeira troca. O tema virou estado da instância, e\n`add()` carimba quem chega depois.\n\nA cor escura das partículas saiu da mesma fórmula que o código já\ndocumentava para a clara — `mix(surface, primary-500, 0.30)` —, depois\nde confirmar que ela reproduz exatamente o `#d1bff3` existente. Sobre o\n`#332161` resultante o texto passa AA com folga: descrição 8,76:1, corpo\n5,53:1, e o título 8,76:1, que no claro era a exceção a 3,30:1.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE §4.4, D5\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"c3a7791b4dcb304dedd2d113c26ebc3ef7359204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/c3a7791b4dcb304dedd2d113c26ebc3ef7359204"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/85a6a30058d195f5ab93f4bfd5ba287cb654a3b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/85a6a30058d195f5ab93f4bfd5ba287cb654a3b1","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDg1YTZhMzAwNThkMTk1ZjVhYjkzZjRiZmQ1YmEyODdjYjY1NGEzYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/1f037951d434a670930591b89b79e525065aba4a","sha":"1f037951d434a670930591b89b79e525065aba4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/1f037951d434a670930591b89b79e525065aba4a"}],"sha":"85a6a30058d195f5ab93f4bfd5ba287cb654a3b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/85a6a30058d195f5ab93f4bfd5ba287cb654a3b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/1f037951d434a670930591b89b79e525065aba4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T22:01:29Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T22:01:29Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs(theme): record the dark mode outcome and the I12 reversal\n\nDARK-MODE.md passa a refletir a Fase 2: quatro desvios do plano\nregistrados — a nav já virava em `xl` e metade do §6 era desnecessária,\no teste do pré-render que quebrou e estava certo, o `setTheme` opcional\nem vez de dado no FrameContext, e a transição que não precisou de guarda\nprópria. Mais a tabela de contraste final, lida do CSS construído.\n\nNo AUDIT.md, I12 é marcado como revertido de propósito, com o porquê: o\nachado valia para o estado em que foi escrito, quando as duas metas\ntraziam a mesma cor. Sem esse registro, a reversão pareceria descuido\ndaqui a alguns meses.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE, I12\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"0c9b026e2e41bcb794b8a92ef558f4077f6337b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/0c9b026e2e41bcb794b8a92ef558f4077f6337b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/1f037951d434a670930591b89b79e525065aba4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/1f037951d434a670930591b89b79e525065aba4a","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDFmMDM3OTUxZDQzNGE2NzA5MzA1OTFiODliNzllNTI1MDY1YWJhNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/d920ccb7e35aff7c9da6d7e113c38d703135e718","sha":"d920ccb7e35aff7c9da6d7e113c38d703135e718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/d920ccb7e35aff7c9da6d7e113c38d703135e718"}],"sha":"1f037951d434a670930591b89b79e525065aba4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/1f037951d434a670930591b89b79e525065aba4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/d920ccb7e35aff7c9da6d7e113c38d703135e718/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:59:51Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:59:51Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"test(theme): assert the anti-flash script on every served page\n\nO anti-flash se propaga para os 8 artigos, a home e a 404 porque o\npré-render monta cada página a partir do `dist/index.html`. \"Se propaga\nsozinho\" é o tipo de afirmação que envelhece mal.\n\nO teste abre as 10 páginas geradas e exige o script presente, inline e\nantes do `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">`. Verificado removendo o script do\n`index.html`: 10 dos 53 testes falham.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE §5\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"ae2f8de97896c0d3406007da27fc58df2411b9f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/ae2f8de97896c0d3406007da27fc58df2411b9f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/d920ccb7e35aff7c9da6d7e113c38d703135e718","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/d920ccb7e35aff7c9da6d7e113c38d703135e718","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGQ5MjBjY2I3ZTM1YWZmN2M5ZGE2ZDdlMTEzYzM4ZDcwMzEzNWU3MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/9e77cc1c5e3fa6655641724b929b444ec7109a99","sha":"9e77cc1c5e3fa6655641724b929b444ec7109a99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9e77cc1c5e3fa6655641724b929b444ec7109a99"}],"sha":"d920ccb7e35aff7c9da6d7e113c38d703135e718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/d920ccb7e35aff7c9da6d7e113c38d703135e718"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9e77cc1c5e3fa6655641724b929b444ec7109a99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:58:38Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:58:38Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(navigation): fit the nav controls by measuring the real font\n\nMedindo os avanços reais da Poppins dos woff2 self-hospedados, em vez de\nestimar: a nav em português precisava de 1.099px contra 1.080px\ndisponíveis a 1280px. **Já estourava antes de o botão de tema existir** —\nele só tornaria o problema maior.\n\nTrês ajustes de densidade, nenhum de conteúdo:\n\n- `gap-8` -> `gap-6` entre os itens;\n- links de `text-xl` (20px) para `text-lg` (18px) a partir de xl;\n- idioma e tema agrupados com `gap-1`, separados dos links. É também a\n  relação correta: os dois são controles da interface, não destinos.\n\nO padding de 100px sobe para `2xl`, já que a nav completa só aparece a\npartir de 1280px.\n\nResultado medido, pior caso (português a 1280px): de -95px para +107px\nde folga. Nenhum nome de seção mudou — as decisões de A10 ficam de pé.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE §6\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"81702d6c6c8470e4ccf85d1d49d7e9ffaeabbe67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/81702d6c6c8470e4ccf85d1d49d7e9ffaeabbe67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/9e77cc1c5e3fa6655641724b929b444ec7109a99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/9e77cc1c5e3fa6655641724b929b444ec7109a99","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDllNzdjYzFjNWUzZmE2NjU1NjQxNzI0YjkyOWI0NDRlYzcxMDlhOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/f4134f34cce4e0f1255da227d2406b2a57a9c7b7","sha":"f4134f34cce4e0f1255da227d2406b2a57a9c7b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/f4134f34cce4e0f1255da227d2406b2a57a9c7b7"}],"sha":"9e77cc1c5e3fa6655641724b929b444ec7109a99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9e77cc1c5e3fa6655641724b929b444ec7109a99"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/f4134f34cce4e0f1255da227d2406b2a57a9c7b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:58:38Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:58:38Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(theme): add the three-state theme control\n\nTrês botões: seguir o sistema, claro e escuro. `system` existe como opção\nexplícita porque é a ausência de escolha, não um terceiro tema — sem ele,\nquem clicou uma vez não teria como voltar a seguir o sistema.\n\nMesmo desenho do seletor de idioma, pelas mesmas razões já decididas em\nA20: `aria-pressed` porque é o mapeamento padrão de estado para\n`<button>`, e o nome do estado em `sr-only` em vez de `aria-label`. Aqui\no `sr-only` é o nome acessível inteiro, não um complemento — o botão só\ntem ícone, então não há texto visível para conter.\n\nAlvo de toque de 44x44px por botão, com o realce visual menor.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE §7\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"c77cc8cc093599563af8b947cc9a155aec480129","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/c77cc8cc093599563af8b947cc9a155aec480129"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/f4134f34cce4e0f1255da227d2406b2a57a9c7b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/f4134f34cce4e0f1255da227d2406b2a57a9c7b7","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGY0MTM0ZjM0Y2NlNGUwZjEyNTVkYTIyN2QyNDA2YjJhNTdhOWM3Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/81024f90faad4c30ce6a78d10070f5817e035cc6","sha":"81024f90faad4c30ce6a78d10070f5817e035cc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/81024f90faad4c30ce6a78d10070f5817e035cc6"}],"sha":"f4134f34cce4e0f1255da227d2406b2a57a9c7b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/f4134f34cce4e0f1255da227d2406b2a57a9c7b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/81024f90faad4c30ce6a78d10070f5817e035cc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:56:56Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:56:56Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(theme): handle what tokens cannot express\n\nTrês casos onde trocar o valor de uma variável não resolve.\n\n**Q1 — gradiente dos títulos de seção.** No escuro a ponta `primary-900`\ndo gradiente fica a 1,34:1 do fundo: ilegível. Não é uma cor, é um PAR,\nentão quem troca é o componente. No escuro ele usa `from-white\nto-primary-200` — o mesmo tratamento que o hero já dava a texto sobre\nsuperfície escura, então não é desenho novo.\n\n**Q8 — sombras.** Sombra preta não existe sobre fundo escuro. Card de\nartigo, card de projeto e painel do menu trocam `shadow` por borda no\nescuro, que é como a elevação se lê num tema escuro.\n\n**Q2 — LayeredStack.** A sombra do objeto 3D era primary-900, que fica a\n1,23:1 do fundo escuro: o volume perdia o contorno. Passa a primary-800\nno escuro — 1,84:1, com a faixa de valor em 0,571 contra os 0,604 do\nclaro, que é o que faz a cena parecer material e não papel.\n\nPara isso o `Feature` ganhou um `setTheme` OPCIONAL, implementado só por\nquem precisa, e o `Experience` observa a classe do `<html>` com\n`MutationObserver`. É o caminho que não exige o experience conhecer o\nReact nem o contrário — mesma independência que o resto da camada 3D já\ntinha.\n\nA troca de tema ganha transição no `body`. Ela não precisa de guarda\nprópria: o bloco de `prefers-reduced-motion` do `index.css` já zera\n`transition-duration` de tudo.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE §1.4, §4.4\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"e6a0d39a3a96a469b14eddede236c0e0c957098d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/e6a0d39a3a96a469b14eddede236c0e0c957098d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/81024f90faad4c30ce6a78d10070f5817e035cc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/81024f90faad4c30ce6a78d10070f5817e035cc6","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDgxMDI0ZjkwZmFhZDRjMzBjZTZhNzhkMTAwNzBmNTgxN2UwMzVjYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/c9fedc0c39de67d1bcba0456cb0b1bc32096ccb0","sha":"c9fedc0c39de67d1bcba0456cb0b1bc32096ccb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c9fedc0c39de67d1bcba0456cb0b1bc32096ccb0"}],"sha":"81024f90faad4c30ce6a78d10070f5817e035cc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/81024f90faad4c30ce6a78d10070f5817e035cc6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c9fedc0c39de67d1bcba0456cb0b1bc32096ccb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:54:31Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:54:31Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"refactor(ui): move components onto the semantic tokens\n\nOs 45 usos de classe de cor viram token de papel: `bg-white` ->\n`bg-surface-raised`, `text-gray-900` -> `text-ink`, `text-primary-600` ->\n`text-accent`, `ring-primary-500` -> `ring-focus`, e assim por diante.\nNenhum `dark:` foi adicionado — o mesmo componente passa a servir os dois\ntemas porque a variável é que muda.\n\nO `body` ganha `bg-page text-ink`: antes o branco vinha do padrão do\nnavegador, e no escuro sobraria branco atrás de tudo.\n\nDuas exceções que ficam com cor literal, e por quê:\n\n- `text-white`, `bg-white/10` e afins continuam onde o fundo é escuro nos\n  DOIS temas — botão de gradiente, rodapé, item destacado de Expertise.\n  Ali branco não é \"a cor do tema claro\", é a cor certa sobre aquela\n  superfície.\n- O rodapé usa `text-footer-muted` em vez de `text-ink-muted`: é a única\n  superfície que não troca de cor entre os temas, então o texto dela\n  também não pode trocar junto com o resto.\n\nOs estilos de artigo entram junto, mesmo vivendo fora de `@layer` por\ncausa do purge das classes `hljs-*`.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE §2.3\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"85513db43aedf436f9e456a7ae64a15ad53167d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/85513db43aedf436f9e456a7ae64a15ad53167d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/c9fedc0c39de67d1bcba0456cb0b1bc32096ccb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/c9fedc0c39de67d1bcba0456cb0b1bc32096ccb0","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGM5ZmVkYzBjMzlkZTY3ZDFiY2JhMDQ1NmNiMGIxYmMzMjA5NmNjYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/34a9215897fc9bd4a66aedc92f158693397a5083","sha":"34a9215897fc9bd4a66aedc92f158693397a5083","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/34a9215897fc9bd4a66aedc92f158693397a5083"}],"sha":"c9fedc0c39de67d1bcba0456cb0b1bc32096ccb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c9fedc0c39de67d1bcba0456cb0b1bc32096ccb0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/34a9215897fc9bd4a66aedc92f158693397a5083/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:52:32Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:52:32Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(theme): resolve and persist the color scheme\n\nTrês estados: `system` por padrão, mais `light` e `dark` explícitos.\n`system` é a ausência de escolha — por isso escolhê-lo APAGA a chave do\nlocalStorage em vez de gravar a string, o que faz a pessoa voltar a\nseguir o sistema de verdade, inclusive em outra aba.\n\nA lógica de resolução mora em `shared/theme.ts`, pura e sem React, por\ndois motivos: dá para testar, e o script anti-flash consegue repetir a\nmesma regra em três linhas sem importar nada.\n\nO anti-flash é inline e síncrono, antes de qualquer CSS. Qualquer coisa\nadiada — módulo, `defer`, React — chega depois do primeiro paint, e o\nflash é exatamente o que ele existe para evitar. Verificado que ele fica\nantes do `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">` que o Vite injeta, nas três formas de\npágina: home, artigo e 404.\n\n`theme-color` volta a ter duas declarações com `media`, revertendo I12 de\npropósito: lá as duas traziam a mesma cor e eram só ruído; aqui trazem\ncores diferentes, que é para o que a media query existe.\n\nIsso quebrou o teste do pré-render de A29, que exigia meta única — e ele\nestava certo em quebrar. A regra correta é mais fina: uma meta pode\nrepetir quando cada ocorrência responde a uma media query diferente.\nO `media` entrou na chave de identidade do teste, então duplicata de\nverdade continua sendo pega.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE §5, I12\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"8182cb2131b162e860f8087d3d3e146a74fd4fb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/8182cb2131b162e860f8087d3d3e146a74fd4fb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/34a9215897fc9bd4a66aedc92f158693397a5083","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/34a9215897fc9bd4a66aedc92f158693397a5083","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDM0YTkyMTU4OTdmYzliZDRhNjZhZWRjOTJmMTU4NjkzMzk3YTUwODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/ed9059990931e818b3339e81487c2bb403ef8c53","sha":"ed9059990931e818b3339e81487c2bb403ef8c53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/ed9059990931e818b3339e81487c2bb403ef8c53"}],"sha":"34a9215897fc9bd4a66aedc92f158693397a5083","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/34a9215897fc9bd4a66aedc92f158693397a5083"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/ed9059990931e818b3339e81487c2bb403ef8c53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:49:26Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:49:26Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(theme): add semantic color tokens for light and dark\n\nOs componentes nomeiam a cor (\"roxo 600\") em 45 pontos. Isso não\nsobrevive a dois temas: cada ponto precisaria de um `dark:` ao lado.\n\nEntram tokens que nomeiam o papel — `page`, `surface`, `surface-raised`,\n`line`, `ink`, `ink-secondary`, `ink-muted`, `accent`, `accent-strong`,\n`focus`, `footer` —, com o valor em variável CSS e o mapeamento no\nTailwind. Trocar de tema passa a ser trocar o valor da variável.\n\nA paleta escura não foi inventada: o site já tinha um vocabulário escuro\nem três lugares — o fundo do hero, os blocos de código dos artigos e o\nrodapé. `--surface`, `--surface-raised` e `--line` são exatamente as\ncores que o bloco de código já usava, e `--page` é o fundo do hero. Daí o\nescuro ser roxo e não cinza.\n\nCanais RGB separados por espaço, e não hex, para o Tailwind aplicar\nopacidade por cima (`bg-surface/80`).\n\n`color-scheme` acompanha: é ele que faz barra de rolagem, `<select>` e\nfoco nativo seguirem o tema.\n\nNenhuma mudança visual: os valores do modo claro são os que já estavam\nem uso, e nada ainda consome os tokens.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE §2\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"539c5f652516ad14beeeacbf1a68c6d0f93f056a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/539c5f652516ad14beeeacbf1a68c6d0f93f056a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/ed9059990931e818b3339e81487c2bb403ef8c53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/ed9059990931e818b3339e81487c2bb403ef8c53","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGVkOTA1OTk5MDkzMWU4MThiMzMzOWU4MTQ4N2MyYmI0MDNlZjhjNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/7a33615f474a38148e988739dfb645d732f02cb1","sha":"7a33615f474a38148e988739dfb645d732f02cb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/7a33615f474a38148e988739dfb645d732f02cb1"}],"sha":"ed9059990931e818b3339e81487c2bb403ef8c53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/ed9059990931e818b3339e81487c2bb403ef8c53"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/7a33615f474a38148e988739dfb645d732f02cb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:42:37Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:42:37Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs(theme): plan the dark mode before writing any of it\n\nFase 1 da task: inventário, tokens semânticos, tabela de contraste e os\ncasos especiais, sem código.\n\nTrês coisas que o plano mudou em relação ao briefing:\n\n- A paleta escura não é inventada. O site já tem um vocabulário escuro\n  espalhado em três lugares — o fundo do hero, os blocos de código dos\n  artigos e o rodapé. A proposta promove essa família a tema, o que\n  atende o pedido de \"roxo, não cinza puro\" sem criar cor nova, e faz o\n  rodapé inverter de papel em vez de sumir.\n\n- A nav foi MEDIDA, não estimada: li os avanços reais da Poppins dos\n  woff2 self-hospedados. O resultado é que a nav em português já estoura\n  hoje, sem botão nenhum — 1.099px contra 1.080px disponíveis a 1280px, e\n  -123px a 1024px. O botão de tema piora, mas não é a causa.\n\n- Corrigi um erro de método meu: marquei `--border` como reprovado por\n  1,34:1, mas WCAG 1.4.11 exige 3:1 de componente de UI, não de divisória\n  decorativa. A borda que é limite de controle está na tabela e passa.\n\nNenhum par de contraste reprova. O mais apertado é o eyebrow do hero,\ncom 4,59:1, herdado do modo claro.\n\nRefs: DARK-MODE\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"397a69636400f30b34ef6b6ca7da394098b97b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/397a69636400f30b34ef6b6ca7da394098b97b9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/7a33615f474a38148e988739dfb645d732f02cb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/7a33615f474a38148e988739dfb645d732f02cb1","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDdhMzM2MTVmNDc0YTM4MTQ4ZTk4ODczOWRmYjY0NWQ3MzJmMDJjYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/85c2d58d75f874d2f210f56872df79c92dbd73b9","sha":"85c2d58d75f874d2f210f56872df79c92dbd73b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/85c2d58d75f874d2f210f56872df79c92dbd73b9"}],"sha":"7a33615f474a38148e988739dfb645d732f02cb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/7a33615f474a38148e988739dfb645d732f02cb1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/85c2d58d75f874d2f210f56872df79c92dbd73b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:28:43Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:28:43Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs(audit): close A29 and tidy the tracker\n\nA16, A29 e I11 marcados com o hash; I03, I04 e I08 marcados como\nresolvidos — estavam sem marca desde f69135e e 9f0c3d2.\n\nA premissa do CTA na tabela de contexto estava desatualizada desde A18:\n\"Let''s talk\" não abre mais o LinkedIn, é âncora para `#contact`.\n\nA seção \"Achados durante a implementação\" ganha subtítulo explicando a\nconvenção de estado, que passou a variar (✅, ⏸️ ou aberto), e a tabela\nde decisões recebe as quatro de A29.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"c4ddb061a7e44c88a1c1aa3dd95c51ee6462d227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/c4ddb061a7e44c88a1c1aa3dd95c51ee6462d227"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/85c2d58d75f874d2f210f56872df79c92dbd73b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/85c2d58d75f874d2f210f56872df79c92dbd73b9","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDg1YzJkNThkNzVmODc0ZDJmMjEwZjU2ODcyZGY3OWM5MmRiZDczYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/6e59def72e0717adbc19f7d2735ada15a9b0d8ca","sha":"6e59def72e0717adbc19f7d2735ada15a9b0d8ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6e59def72e0717adbc19f7d2735ada15a9b0d8ca"}],"sha":"85c2d58d75f874d2f210f56872df79c92dbd73b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/85c2d58d75f874d2f210f56872df79c92dbd73b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6e59def72e0717adbc19f7d2735ada15a9b0d8ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:28:08Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:28:08Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(routing): move articles to real paths and prerender their metadata\n\nOs oito artigos viviam em `#/artigos/<slug>`. O fragmento não é enviado\nao servidor e não faz parte da identidade de uma URL para o buscador,\nentão todos eram a mesma URL que a home — o próprio `sitemap.xml`\ndeclarava nove endereços que colapsavam em um.\n\n**Rota de path** (History API, `pushState` + `popstate`). Os links de\nartigo são `<a href>` reais para `/artigos/<slug>`; o `ArticleLink`\nintercepta só o clique primário sem modificadores, então clique do meio,\nCtrl+clique e \"abrir em nova aba\" continuam com o navegador. View\nTransitions, anterior/próximo e as âncoras de seção seguem iguais — e o\nsumário volta a usar `#<id>` puro, porque o fragmento deixou de carregar\na rota junto.\n\n**Links antigos** viram o caminho novo por `replaceState` no boot. Esse\ncódigo é permanente e está comentado como tal: o fragmento nunca chega ao\nservidor, então nenhum redirecionamento da Vercel alcança\n`#/artigos/<slug>`, e os quatro artigos do Medium apontam para cá nesse\nformato.\n\n**Pré-render C1**: `postbuild` gera `dist/artigos/<slug>/index.html` a\npartir da casca do build, com title, description, canonical e os blocos\nog/twitter próprios. Só metadado — o corpo continua vazio, e quem executa\nJS recebe a página inteira como sempre.\n\nO pré-render usa o mesmo idioma padrão do runtime (`en`) e resolve o\nthumb com hash do `dist/assets`, porque a regra é que o HTML servido e o\n`useSEO` digam a mesma coisa para a mesma rota. No caminho apareceu que o\n`og:image` de artigo era relativo (`/assets/...`), que scraper descarta —\nagora é absoluto nos dois lados.\n\n**A16**: o canonical dos oito passa a ser o próprio site. Antes quatro\napontavam para o Medium, o que mandava o buscador indexar a plataforma e\nignorar esta página; com rota de hash isso nem tinha alternativa. O link\n\"Also on Medium\" continua como referência.\n\n**I11**: `twitter:url` acompanha a rota, em vez de ficar fixo na home.\n\nMais: `vercel.json` com `trailingSlash: false` e sem rewrite genérico —\numa rota inexistente responde 404 de verdade, com uma página estática que\nnão carrega o app; `SITE_ORIGIN` em `shared/site.ts` no lugar das 24\nocorrências escritas à mão; sitemap e RSS com os endereços novos, mantendo\no `<guid>` para os leitores não tratarem os oito como novos.\n\n`tsconfig.node.json` passa a incluir `scripts/**/*.ts`: o teste do\npré-render ficava fora do typecheck, e erro de tipo ali passava silencioso.\n\nRefs: A29, A16, I11\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"4690cd1934ae5998783cef8cafcb0040b9c051be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/4690cd1934ae5998783cef8cafcb0040b9c051be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/6e59def72e0717adbc19f7d2735ada15a9b0d8ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/6e59def72e0717adbc19f7d2735ada15a9b0d8ca","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDZlNTlkZWY3MmUwNzE3YWRiYzE5ZjdkMjczNWFkYTE1YTliMGQ4Y2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/6d9478d40f23ded334a5c537565bb0ff67fe4988","sha":"6d9478d40f23ded334a5c537565bb0ff67fe4988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6d9478d40f23ded334a5c537565bb0ff67fe4988"}],"sha":"6e59def72e0717adbc19f7d2735ada15a9b0d8ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6e59def72e0717adbc19f7d2735ada15a9b0d8ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6d9478d40f23ded334a5c537565bb0ff67fe4988/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:09:39Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:09:39Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs(audit): close Stage 5 and tidy the tracker\n\nMarca A21, A22, A24 a A28 e I05, I07, I10, I12, I13 com o hash. Unifica\nI14 em I07, que era o mesmo achado registrado duas vezes.\n\nA19 é fechado **sem alteração de código**: o achado foi levantado três\nvezes e a confirmação no navegador nunca chegou. A causa continua\nprovada no código, o efeito não — e corrigir às cegas mexeria no\nenquadramento do hero por suposição. Reabrir é barato.\n\nO cabeçalho passa a refletir o estado real: 26 dos 29 fechados, com A16\nsuspenso por A29, A29 investigado mas não implementado, e A19 fechado\nsem confirmação.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"af42c160428b6a8ad3d2a7e60355f9508bd35b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/af42c160428b6a8ad3d2a7e60355f9508bd35b33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/6d9478d40f23ded334a5c537565bb0ff67fe4988","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/6d9478d40f23ded334a5c537565bb0ff67fe4988","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDZkOTQ3OGQ0MGYyM2RlZDMzNGE1YzUzNzU2NWJiMGZmNjdmZTQ5ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/c1fe06e6fe6635280fb6d5fca9dc2541479c001d","sha":"c1fe06e6fe6635280fb6d5fca9dc2541479c001d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c1fe06e6fe6635280fb6d5fca9dc2541479c001d"}],"sha":"6d9478d40f23ded334a5c537565bb0ff67fe4988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6d9478d40f23ded334a5c537565bb0ff67fe4988"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c1fe06e6fe6635280fb6d5fca9dc2541479c001d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:09:04Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:09:04Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"chore: fix the console greeting and remove dead keys\n\n**A26** — `WELCOME_LOG_MESSAGE` começava com os bytes `EF BF BD`, o\nU+FFFD de substituição, onde deveria haver um emoji: corrupção de\nencoding gravada no source. A mensagem também era só em português, num\nsite que abre em inglês, e anunciava Next.js — que é a stack do\ntrabalho, não a deste site, feito em Vite.\n\n**A27** e achados agrupados — chaves de locale sem consumidor:\n\n- `articles.items.*`: a seção passou a ler o catálogo `ARTICLES`\n- `a11y.hireOnLinkedIn`: A08 trocou o `aria-label` por texto `sr-only` (I07)\n- `article.back`: A22 renomeou para `allArticles`\n\nMais o `mr-7` solto no botão de Self, sem vizinho à direita; o\n`key={index}` do rodapé, que virou `key={link.href}` como no menu mobile\n(I05); e as duas `theme-color` que traziam a mesma cor por media query,\nagora uma só (I12).\n\nRefs: A26, A27, I05, I07, I12\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"76b26fdbd935ab3f81274af51c9ca813db052baa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/76b26fdbd935ab3f81274af51c9ca813db052baa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/c1fe06e6fe6635280fb6d5fca9dc2541479c001d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c