/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/614d18abddb143d3defff832c9f0fab60ddbbbc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:09:04Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:09:04Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(ui): run the reveal once and show the focus ring only on keyboard\n\n**A24** — `ProjectCard` e `SkillCard` traziam `animate-fade-in-up`, e os\nwrappers em `projects/` e `skills/` aplicavam a mesma classe de novo,\ncom `animationDelay` inline. A animação rodava duas vezes, em elementos\naninhados. Fica só no wrapper, que é quem sabe o índice e o atraso.\n\nJunto sai o `relative` declarado duas vezes no `className` do\n`ProjectCard`.\n\n**A25** — o `Button` usava `focus:ring`, então o anel aparecia também no\nclique de mouse. `Link`, `ArticleCard`, `ProjectCard` e `SkillCard` já\nusavam `focus-visible:`. Agora os cinco combinam.\n\nRefs: A24, A25, A27\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"c93f2b3669371a5d05763b3fb2ac48f0d94e5a93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/c93f2b3669371a5d05763b3fb2ac48f0d94e5a93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/614d18abddb143d3defff832c9f0fab60ddbbbc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/614d18abddb143d3defff832c9f0fab60ddbbbc6","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDYxNGQxOGFiZGRiMTQzZDNkZWZmZjgzMmM5ZjBmYWI2MGRkYmJiYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/61ac312f9ddd5cfcd103324147fa8e57380034ec","sha":"61ac312f9ddd5cfcd103324147fa8e57380034ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/61ac312f9ddd5cfcd103324147fa8e57380034ec"}],"sha":"614d18abddb143d3defff832c9f0fab60ddbbbc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/614d18abddb143d3defff832c9f0fab60ddbbbc6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/61ac312f9ddd5cfcd103324147fa8e57380034ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:07:26Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:07:26Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(articles): respect reduced motion and point \"back\" at the list\n\n**A21** — `scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\" })` ignorava a preferência\nde movimento. O `index.css` já zera animação e `scroll-behavior` sob\n`prefers-reduced-motion`, mas a opção passada em JS tem precedência sobre\no CSS: quem pediu menos movimento continuava vendo a página deslizar ao\nabrir uma seção do artigo.\n\nO novo `useReducedMotion` reaproveita o `watchReducedMotion` do\n`experience/quality.ts`, que já é dono da media query e já é importado\nestaticamente — sem custo novo de bundle e sem a string duplicada.\n`quality.ts` ganha só uma leitura pontual de uma linha.\n\n**A22** — o botão dizia \"Voltar\", prometendo histórico, e executava\n`location.hash = \"\"`, que vai para o topo da home. Agora diz \"Todos os\nartigos\" / \"All articles\" e vai para a seção `#articles`.\n\nIsso exigiu perseguir a seção, porque as seções da home são lazy e o\nalvo não existe no instante da troca. A rotina de espera que o\n`useAnchorScroll` já tinha foi extraída em `landWhenSettled` e exposta\npor `goToSection`. O menu continua indo para o topo da home vindo de um\nartigo, como decidido antes: perseguir a seção é opt-in de quem pede.\n\nRefs: A21, A22\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"e78743fb3bc266c78720d5d511f0ebedd7d548b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/e78743fb3bc266c78720d5d511f0ebedd7d548b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/61ac312f9ddd5cfcd103324147fa8e57380034ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/61ac312f9ddd5cfcd103324147fa8e57380034ec","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDYxYWMzMTJmOWRkZDVjZmNkMTAzMzI0MTQ3ZmE4ZTU3MzgwMDM0ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/15ff06d3c41d72dcb96c16ebc18754eeca91207a","sha":"15ff06d3c41d72dcb96c16ebc18754eeca91207a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/15ff06d3c41d72dcb96c16ebc18754eeca91207a"}],"sha":"61ac312f9ddd5cfcd103324147fa8e57380034ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/61ac312f9ddd5cfcd103324147fa8e57380034ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/15ff06d3c41d72dcb96c16ebc18754eeca91207a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:05:01Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:05:01Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"perf(fonts): self-host Poppins and drop the third-party request\n\nA fonte vinha por `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">` para fonts.googleapis.com:\num CSS de terceiro no caminho crítico, que só depois disparava o\ndownload dos `.woff2` em fonts.gstatic.com. Eram dois handshakes — DNS\nmais TLS, em dois hosts — antes de qualquer texto aparecer. Caro num\nAndroid de entrada em 4G, que é o aparelho de referência do projeto.\n\nOs cinco cortes passam a morar em `public/fonts/`, com `@font-face` no\n`index.css` e `font-display: swap` mantido. Só o subset `latin`: foi\nverificado que nenhuma letra do site ou dos artigos cai fora dele, já\nque os acentos do português vivem todos no Latin-1 Supplement.\n\nSó o corte do `<h1>` (700) é pré-carregado; os outros quatro chegam\nquando o CSS pede. O `crossorigin` no preload é obrigatório mesmo na\nmesma origem — sem ele o navegador baixa a fonte duas vezes.\n\n  antes   2 hosts de terceiro, CSS de 5.989 B bloqueando render,\n          depois os mesmos 5 woff2\n  depois  0 hosts de terceiro, 40.116 B de woff2 na própria origem,\n          1 deles pré-carregado\n\nRefs: A28\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"9738f75cf357ee5c5d3710ad111f9e33b6dd9c52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/9738f75cf357ee5c5d3710ad111f9e33b6dd9c52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/15ff06d3c41d72dcb96c16ebc18754eeca91207a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/15ff06d3c41d72dcb96c16ebc18754eeca91207a","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDE1ZmYwNmQzYzQxZDcyZGNiOTZjMTZlYmMxODc1NGVlY2E5MTIwN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/4a7b43f9074c18bac2135a015e4ee9906c6deec3","sha":"4a7b43f9074c18bac2135a015e4ee9906c6deec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4a7b43f9074c18bac2135a015e4ee9906c6deec3"}],"sha":"15ff06d3c41d72dcb96c16ebc18754eeca91207a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/15ff06d3c41d72dcb96c16ebc18754eeca91207a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4a7b43f9074c18bac2135a015e4ee9906c6deec3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:03:00Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T21:03:00Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"test: add vitest and cover the catalog date helper\n\nA verificação obrigatória do projeto era typecheck, lint e build —\nnenhuma delas executa código. Isso apareceu ao corrigir I10: o\n`formatCatalogDate` é exatamente o tipo de função que um teste tranca em\ntrês linhas, e a prova de que funcionava era eu rodar `Intl` em quatro\nfusos pelo terminal, o que mostra o comportamento de hoje mas não impede\na regressão de amanhã.\n\nO vitest reaproveita a config do Vite inteira — plugins, alias e tudo;\nsó o bloco `test` é dele. `defineConfig` passa a vir de `vitest/config`,\nque é o único que conhece esse bloco.\n\nSeis casos cobrem fuso negativo (America/Manaus, onde o bug aparecia),\nfuso positivo (Asia/Tokyo, que erraria na direção oposta), o dia 01 e a\nigualdade entre quatro fusos. O último caso é uma guarda: prova que a\nformatação ingênua devolve \"Dec 2025\" para 2026-01-01, então os outros\nnão passariam por acidente num CI rodando em UTC. Verificado removendo o\n`timeZone: \"UTC\"` do helper — três dos seis falham.\n\n`vitest@^2` porque a linha 5 exige Vite 6 (`vite/module-runner`) e o\nprojeto está no Vite 5.4. A entrada em `resolutions` existe porque o\nvitest aninhava a própria cópia do Vite, e aí `vitest/config` e os\nplugins apontavam para instâncias de tipo diferentes — o typecheck\nquebrava mesmo com os testes passando.\n\nRefs: I13\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"499044a7df0e859259ea2330993b63162102cfcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/499044a7df0e859259ea2330993b63162102cfcb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/4a7b43f9074c18bac2135a015e4ee9906c6deec3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/4a7b43f9074c18bac2135a015e4ee9906c6deec3","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDRhN2I0M2Y5MDc0YzE4YmFjMjEzNWEwMTVlNGVlOTkwNmM2ZGVlYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/5a3fbf1d0015bf315e26f52ccfb4dbcfdf829df0","sha":"5a3fbf1d0015bf315e26f52ccfb4dbcfdf829df0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/5a3fbf1d0015bf315e26f52ccfb4dbcfdf829df0"}],"sha":"4a7b43f9074c18bac2135a015e4ee9906c6deec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4a7b43f9074c18bac2135a015e4ee9906c6deec3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/5a3fbf1d0015bf315e26f52ccfb4dbcfdf829df0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:56:35Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:56:35Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs(audit): record Stage 4 and what it left open\n\nA20 e I10 concluídos com hash. A19 continua aberto e passa a constar\ncomo \"aguardando confirmação no navegador\": a causa está provada no\ncódigo, mas o efeito não, e não há browser headless no ambiente para\nverificar.\n\nRegistra I13 (o projeto não tem runner de testes, o que apareceu ao\nimplementar I10) e I14 (a chave órfã de I07 segue pendente em A27).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"7cd7065bf3d6a3895b6e21756ac2b559add6e53b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/7cd7065bf3d6a3895b6e21756ac2b559add6e53b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/5a3fbf1d0015bf315e26f52ccfb4dbcfdf829df0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/5a3fbf1d0015bf315e26f52ccfb4dbcfdf829df0","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDVhM2ZiZjFkMDAxNWJmMzE1ZTI2ZjUyY2NmYjRkYmNmZGY4MjlkZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/e2cf44b0ad40ba9186958bb103e94cc590e0b4a0","sha":"e2cf44b0ad40ba9186958bb103e94cc590e0b4a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/e2cf44b0ad40ba9186958bb103e94cc590e0b4a0"}],"sha":"5a3fbf1d0015bf315e26f52ccfb4dbcfdf829df0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/5a3fbf1d0015bf315e26f52ccfb4dbcfdf829df0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/e2cf44b0ad40ba9186958bb103e94cc590e0b4a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:56:11Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:56:11Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(i18n): replace the flag switch with a real language selector\n\nO seletor era um switch de 56x28px cujo único conteúdo visível era 🇺🇸 ou\n🇧🇷 em 12px. Bandeira representa país, não língua: o inglês do site não é\n\"dos EUA\", e português não é exclusivo do Brasil. Pior, o formato de\nswitch é o vocabulário de liga/desliga — o mesmo de um toggle de tema\nescuro —, então não dava para saber o que ele fazia sem passar o mouse e\nler o `title`, o que não existe no toque.\n\nAgora são dois botões com o código do idioma. Escolhas:\n\n- **`aria-pressed`, não `aria-current`**: é o mapeamento padrão de estado\n  para `<button>`. `aria-current` descreve \"o item atual de um conjunto\"\n  e é idiomático em navegação, com links.\n- **nome do idioma em `sr-only`, não em `aria-label`**: `aria-label`\n  substituiria o texto visível, e o nome acessível precisa conter o que\n  está escrito na tela (WCAG 2.5.3). O leitor anuncia \"EN English\". Os\n  nomes ficam no próprio idioma, que é a convenção de um seletor — quem\n  procura português não lê \"Portuguese\".\n- **44x44px de alvo por botão**, com o realce visual menor que isso.\n\nContraste: ativo 5,56:1 (branco sobre primary-500), inativo 7,56:1.\n\n`useLocales` passa a expor `selectLanguage(code)` no lugar de\n`toggleLanguage()`: com dois botões, cada um sabe qual idioma representa.\nA chave `a11y.switchLanguage` sai junto, substituída pelo par.\n\nRefs: A20\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"243dc9a7713c0a4fc4136bac9d37f0154afa3a5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/243dc9a7713c0a4fc4136bac9d37f0154afa3a5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/e2cf44b0ad40ba9186958bb103e94cc590e0b4a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/e2cf44b0ad40ba9186958bb103e94cc590e0b4a0","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGUyY2Y0NGIwYWQ0MGJhOTE4Njk1OGJiMTAzZTk0Y2M1OTBlMGI0YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/3aeb9d1e1b0976e4087d0f9880cd5c49e0a2fdb1","sha":"3aeb9d1e1b0976e4087d0f9880cd5c49e0a2fdb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/3aeb9d1e1b0976e4087d0f9880cd5c49e0a2fdb1"}],"sha":"e2cf44b0ad40ba9186958bb103e94cc590e0b4a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/e2cf44b0ad40ba9186958bb103e94cc590e0b4a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/3aeb9d1e1b0976e4087d0f9880cd5c49e0a2fdb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:53:55Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:53:55Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(articles): stop shifting the publication date by a day\n\n`new Date(\"2026-09-21\")` é lido como meia-noite UTC, e o\n`Intl.DateTimeFormat` formata no fuso local. Em qualquer fuso a oeste de\nGreenwich — o que inclui o Brasil inteiro — a data saía um dia atrás:\n\n  UTC               -> 21 de setembro de 2026\n  America/Manaus    -> 20 de setembro de 2026\n  America/Sao_Paulo -> 20 de setembro de 2026\n\nA página do artigo mostrava a data errada para quem lê daqui. O card,\nque mostra só mês e ano, só erraria em artigo de dia 01 — nenhum dos\noito atuais, mas era questão de tempo.\n\nOs dois passam a usar um helper único, `formatCatalogDate`, que formata\ncom `timeZone: \"UTC\"` e devolve a mesma data de calendário escrita no\ncatálogo em qualquer fuso. É o mesmo princípio que o\n`scripts/content/build-feeds.js` já usava ao ancorar o `pubDate` em\n`T12:00:00Z`.\n\nVerificado em UTC, Manaus, São Paulo e Tóquio — este último porque um\nparse local erraria na direção oposta.\n\nRefs: I10\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"8f18868c354a59153750d65dd229a6182dbbef17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/8f18868c354a59153750d65dd229a6182dbbef17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/3aeb9d1e1b0976e4087d0f9880cd5c49e0a2fdb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/3aeb9d1e1b0976e4087d0f9880cd5c49e0a2fdb1","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDNhZWI5ZDFlMWIwOTc2ZTQwODdkMGY5ODgwY2Q1YzQ5ZTBhMmZkYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/e26abc7ad5ece4b5a5ebc211b72191dfd4f0f466","sha":"e26abc7ad5ece4b5a5ebc211b72191dfd4f0f466","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/e26abc7ad5ece4b5a5ebc211b72191dfd4f0f466"}],"sha":"3aeb9d1e1b0976e4087d0f9880cd5c49e0a2fdb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/3aeb9d1e1b0976e4087d0f9880cd5c49e0a2fdb1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/e26abc7ad5ece4b5a5ebc211b72191dfd4f0f466/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:48:23Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:48:23Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs(audit): record the Stage 3 decisions\n\n\"Contact\" não entra na nav nem no rodapé: o CTA já leva a `#contact`, e\num link a mais seria um segundo destino igual na mesma nav — além do\nrisco de estourar a largura da nav desktop a 1024px.\n\nI06 (subtítulos com voz abaixo dos h2) fica adiado, marcado na seção de\nachados e na nova tabela de decisões, junto com a suspensão de A16.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"fd89fc41aedeb5f3bd414eb64eb00d6d01b06764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/fd89fc41aedeb5f3bd414eb64eb00d6d01b06764"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/e26abc7ad5ece4b5a5ebc211b72191dfd4f0f466","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url"