m/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/8983bceeb542ca23198a00347b7f688c24ac5ac0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:46:51Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:46:51Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs(audit): add A29 on hash routing, suspend A16\n\nInvestigação pedida na Etapa 3. O diagnóstico se confirma e tem\nevidência dura no próprio repositório: o `sitemap.xml` declara nove\n`<loc>` que colapsam em uma única URL quando o fragmento é ignorado.\n\nA29 registra a confirmação, o levantamento da hospedagem (indefinida, e\nGitHub Pages seria a única sem rewrite de SPA), três opções de\npré-render com esforço e limite de cada uma, os riscos da migração e o\nque muda em A15 e A16 depois dela.\n\nA16 passa a constar como suspenso por A29: com rota de hash, canonical\npara `davysz.com/#/...` equivale a canonical para a home, então a\ndecisão hoje é tomada pela arquitetura, não por estratégia.\n\nRegistra também I10 (data do artigo erra um dia a oeste de UTC), I11\n(`twitter:url` fixo) e I12 (`theme-color` duplicado).\n\nRefs: A29, A16\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"3a58b3cff2e3e81f3f46d5fac212bcc419ba19fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/3a58b3cff2e3e81f3f46d5fac212bcc419ba19fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/8983bceeb542ca23198a00347b7f688c24ac5ac0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/8983bceeb542ca23198a00347b7f688c24ac5ac0","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDg5ODNiY2VlYjU0MmNhMjMxOThhMDAzNDdiN2Y2ODhjMjRhYzVhYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/9f0c3d2b1cdfa13cca3d74eb481c43747eab3c85","sha":"9f0c3d2b1cdfa13cca3d74eb481c43747eab3c85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9f0c3d2b1cdfa13cca3d74eb481c43747eab3c85"}],"sha":"8983bceeb542ca23198a00347b7f688c24ac5ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/8983bceeb542ca23198a00347b7f688c24ac5ac0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9f0c3d2b1cdfa13cca3d74eb481c43747eab3c85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:45:16Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:45:16Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(contact): give the page a destination that stays on the site\n\nA página existe para gerar contato e não tinha para onde levar. O CTA\nmais destacado abria o LinkedIn antes de a pessoa ter visto qualquer\ncoisa, e quem chegava convencido no fim encontrava e-mail e telefone como\ntexto para copiar à mão.\n\nAgora há um bloco de contato antes do rodapé, com os três caminhos\njuntos: e-mail com `mailto:` e um botão de copiar ao lado, LinkedIn e\ntelefone. Dois dos três não exigem sair do site.\n\nO \"Vamos conversar\" das duas navegações passa a ser âncora para\n`#contact` em vez de link externo. Isso também resolve I08: o nome\nacessível não precisa mais avisar de nova aba, porque o CTA não sai mais\ndo site — e o LinkedIn, que continua saindo, avisa no próprio bloco.\n\nCopiar e escrever são ações diferentes, então o botão de copiar fica fora\ndo link em vez de disputar o clique com ele. O resultado é anunciado por\numa região `role=\"status\"` que vive sempre no DOM: o rótulo do botão já\nmuda, mas um texto que troca sozinho não chega a quem usa leitor de tela,\ne uma região viva inserida junto com o texto costuma não ser anunciada.\n\nRefs: A18, I08\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"4af628fb4d85e34de4b12b8e36f0c7e18e4fe291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/4af628fb4d85e34de4b12b8e36f0c7e18e4fe291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/9f0c3d2b1cdfa13cca3d74eb481c43747eab3c85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/9f0c3d2b1cdfa13cca3d74eb481c43747eab3c85","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDlmMGMzZDJiMWNkZmExM2NjYTNkNzRlYjQ4MWM0Mzc0N2VhYjNjODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/1e326d4577d746da23945c61eef7cc287b4e5c24","sha":"1e326d4577d746da23945c61eef7cc287b4e5c24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/1e326d4577d746da23945c61eef7cc287b4e5c24"}],"sha":"9f0c3d2b1cdfa13cca3d74eb481c43747eab3c85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9f0c3d2b1cdfa13cca3d74eb481c43747eab3c85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/1e326d4577d746da23945c61eef7cc287b4e5c24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:42:29Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:42:29Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(articles): show the publication date on the card\n\n`ArticleMeta.date` existia desde sempre, e o comentário no catálogo dizia\n\"usado para ordenar e para o `<time>`\" — mas o card nunca renderizou um\n`<time>`. Numa listagem que vai de dez/2025 a set/2026, nada disso era\nvisível para quem escolhe o que ler (A17).\n\nMês e ano bastam aqui: o dia exato só importa dentro do artigo, onde a\ndata completa já aparece. O `dateTime` leva o ISO, então quem lê a\nmarcação recebe a data precisa de qualquer forma.\n\nJunto sai a repetição da tag: quando o artigo não tem thumb, a capa\ntipográfica gerada já mostra a tag em letras grandes, e logo abaixo vinha\na mesma palavra de novo, empilhada. Agora a linha só traz a tag quando há\nthumb (A23).\n\nRefs: A17, A23\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"1d297f1e42c9f1efffb8b72377c6cabccf5991bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/1d297f1e42c9f1efffb8b72377c6cabccf5991bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/1e326d4577d746da23945c61eef7cc287b4e5c24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/1e326d4577d746da23945c61eef7cc287b4e5c24","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDFlMzI2ZDQ1NzdkNzQ2ZGEyMzk0NWM2MWVlZjdjYzI4N2I0ZTVjMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/9067d32e4e4737bf9bf70b00b2e4ae712894c308","sha":"9067d32e4e4737bf9bf70b00b2e4ae712894c308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9067d32e4e4737bf9bf70b00b2e4ae712894c308"}],"sha":"1e326d4577d746da23945c61eef7cc287b4e5c24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/1e326d4577d746da23945c61eef7cc287b4e5c24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9067d32e4e4737bf9bf70b00b2e4ae712894c308/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:41:39Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:41:39Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(seo): update meta tags in place instead of appending them\n\nO `useSEO` acrescentava tags marcadas com `data-dynamic=\"true\"` e, na\ntroca, removia só as que tinham essa marca. As estáticas do `index.html`\ncontinuavam ali: o documento ficava com duas `description`, dois\n`og:description` e dois `og:locale`. Crawler e scraper de rede social que\nnão executam JS — que é o caso de boa parte deles — leem a primeira, e a\nprimeira estava em português num site que abre em inglês.\n\nAgora cada tag é procurada por `name`/`property` e atualizada no lugar,\ncriando só o que não existir. As 15 tags gerenciadas já estão declaradas\nno HTML, então em runtime o documento tem exatamente as mesmas que tinha\nao carregar.\n\nOs valores estáticos passam para inglês, que é o idioma padrão do site, e\n`og:locale` vira `en_US` com `og:locale:alternate` `pt_BR`. O alternate\ntambém passa a ser gerenciado: sem isso, trocar para português deixaria\n`og:locale=pt_BR` contradizendo um alternate fixo em `pt_BR`.\n\nO `<noscript>`, que era só português, passa a trazer os dois idiomas com\n`lang` declarado no bloco em português.\n\nRefs: A15\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"074bece5733b698bc8c9a674b2b241b9d7174ef0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/074bece5733b698bc8c9a674b2b241b9d7174ef0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/9067d32e4e4737bf9bf70b00b2e4ae712894c308","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/9067d32e4e4737bf9bf70b00b2e4ae712894c308","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDkwNjdkMzJlNGU0NzM3YmY5YmY3MGIwMGIyZTRhZTcxMjg5NGMzMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/b4615908f855f860d910618357f2b6b12114c80c","sha":"b4615908f855f860d910618357f2b6b12114c80c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/b4615908f855f860d910618357f2b6b12114c80c"}],"sha":"9067d32e4e4737bf9bf70b00b2e4ae712894c308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/9067d32e4e4737bf9bf70b00b2e4ae712894c308"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/b4615908f855f860d910618357f2b6b12114c80c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:37:13Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:37:13Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs(audit): record Stage 2 as implemented\n\nMarca A02, A05, A08, A09, A12 e A14 com o hash, corrige o 5,79:1 que\ntinha sobrado no item 2 da ordem sugerida e abre três registros novos:\na chave de locale que ficou órfã com A08, a perda do destino no nome\nacessível do CTA, e os três deltas visuais da reescrita da seção de\nExpertise.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"65f1605d19170a5fc9a3703a454e0ad2e4108d68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/65f1605d19170a5fc9a3703a454e0ad2e4108d68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/b4615908f855f860d910618357f2b6b12114c80c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/b4615908f855f860d910618357f2b6b12114c80c","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGI0NjE1OTA4Zjg1NWY4NjBkOTEwNjE4MzU3ZjJiNmIxMjExNGM4MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/34fb76a7d8f84eed1b51ea3130004bcd5d809d9f","sha":"34fb76a7d8f84eed1b51ea3130004bcd5d809d9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/34fb76a7d8f84eed1b51ea3130004bcd5d809d9f"}],"sha":"b4615908f855f860d910618357f2b6b12114c80c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/b4615908f855f860d910618357f2b6b12114c80c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/34fb76a7d8f84eed1b51ea3130004bcd5d809d9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:36:39Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:36:39Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(links): use real anchors for every external destination\n\nCinco lugares navegavam com `<button onClick={() => window.open(href,\n\"_blank\")}>`: as redes sociais do hero e do rodapé, o \"ver todos os\nartigos\" no Medium e o \"Vamos conversar\" nas duas navegações.\n\nUm botão que navega perde clique do meio, \"abrir em nova aba\", \"copiar\nendereço do link\" e o destino na barra de status. O leitor de tela\nanuncia \"botão\", então a pessoa não sabe que vai sair do site — e os\ncards de artigo e de projeto já faziam certo com `<a>`, então a\ninconsistência era interna (A08).\n\n`rel=\"noopener\"` fecha a outra ponta: ao contrário de `<a\ntarget=\"_blank\">`, que ganhou `noopener` implícito nos navegadores\nmodernos, `window.open` entrega `window.opener` para a página aberta, que\npode reescrever a aba de origem (A09).\n\nO novo `ExternalLink` tem a cara do botão porque divide com ele a mesma\nfonte de estilo, extraída para `button/styles.ts` — com as classes num\nlugar só, os dois não têm como divergir. O aviso de nova aba é texto\n`sr-only` e não `aria-label`, que substituiria o aviso em vez de somar a\nele; por isso o nome acessível dos links só de ícone também passou a sair\nde texto real.\n\nRefs: A08, A09\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"a3bc0171cfce6824f7ade8b023a46b5316860b34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/a3bc0171cfce6824f7ade8b023a46b5316860b34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/34fb76a7d8f84eed1b51ea3130004bcd5d809d9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/34fb76a7d8f84eed1b51ea3130004bcd5d809d9f","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDM0ZmI3NmE3ZDhmODRlZWQxYjUxZWEzMTMwMDA0YmNkNWQ4MDlkOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/a84290d1101fac444b0a1b5d592853147980a3ff","sha":"a84290d1101fac444b0a1b5d592853147980a3ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/a84290d1101fac444b0a1b5d592853147980a3ff"}],"sha":"34fb76a7d8f84eed1b51ea3130004bcd5d809d9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/34fb76a7d8f84eed1b51ea3130004bcd5d809d9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/a84290d1101fac444b0a1b5d592853147980a3ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:33:36Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:33:36Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(navigation): complete the modal contract in the mobile menu\n\nO painel declarava `role=\"dialog\"` e `aria-modal=\"true\"`, tinha Esc e\nusava `inert` quando fechado — mas faltava o resto do contrato. Ao abrir,\no foco continuava no hambúrguer, que está FORA do diálogo. Como\n`aria-modal` esconde o resto da página do leitor de tela, a pessoa ficava\ncom o foco num elemento que, para ela, tinha deixado de existir, e o Tab\npasseava por conteúdo invisível.\n\nAgora, ao abrir, o foco vai para o botão de fechar; o Tab e o Shift+Tab\ncirculam dentro do painel; e fechar por qualquer caminho — botão, Esc,\nbackdrop ou clique num link — devolve o foco a quem abriu.\n\nO `inert` novo vai no conteúdo da página, não na barra do topo: o ícone\ndo hambúrguer vira um X enquanto o menu está aberto e continua sendo o\ncaminho de fechar para quem usa mouse. Quem usa teclado fecha pelo botão\ndo painel ou pelo Esc, e o Tab não chega até lá.\n\nImplementação própria, sem dependência nova. O `inert` do painel fechado\ne o Esc continuam como estavam.\n\nRefs: A05\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"b8fd355977873b184b297ca5945b2bee86da03d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/b8fd355977873b184b297ca5945b2bee86da03d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/a84290d1101fac444b0a1b5d592853147980a3ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/a84290d1101fac444b0a1b5d592853147980a3ff","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGE4NDI5MGQxMTAxZmFjNDQ0YjBhMWI1ZDU5Mjg1MzE0Nzk4MGEzZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/f69135e8b00b1e7e7727567f8694621619b0f202","sha":"f69135e8b00b1e7e7727567f8694621619b0f202","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/f69135e8b00b1e7e7727567f8694621619b0f202"}],"sha":"a84290d1101fac444b0a1b5d592853147980a3ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/a84290d1101fac444b0a1b5d592853147980a3ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/f69135e8b00b1e7e7727567f8694621619b0f202/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:31:52Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:31:52Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"refactor(services): turn the expertise table into one semantic list\n\nO mesmo conteúdo era renderizado por dois componentes com DOMs\ndiferentes: uma `<table>` sem `<th>` nem `<caption>` no desktop e cards\nno mobile. A tabela fazia o leitor de tela anunciar \"tabela, 4 linhas, 4\ncolunas\" e entrar em navegação por células, onde as setas passam a andar\ncélula a célula — o usuário procurava relações de linha/coluna que nunca\nexistiram. Isto sempre foi uma lista.\n\n`ServiceTable` e `ServiceCards` viram `ServiceList`: um `<ul>` com `<h3>`\ne `<p>` por item, mesmo DOM em qualquer largura. O que muda por\nbreakpoint é só CSS — cards empilhados no mobile, faixas de duas colunas\na partir de `md`.\n\nJunto saem:\n\n- a escala de tipografia do tema no lugar de `text-4xl`, `text-[40px]`,\n  `text-[32px]`, `text-xl` e `text-base`, que ignoravam o line-height e o\n  letter-spacing pensados por degrau (A12). O título desktop passa de\n  32px para `display-sm` (30px), o degrau mais próximo;\n- o seletor de tipo `td, th` global do `index.css`, que aplicava 100px de\n  padding horizontal a qualquer tabela do site — incluindo as que viessem\n  do markdown dos artigos (A14). Busca confirmou que a ServiceTable era o\n  único consumidor;\n- a numeração 01–04, que dizia \"isto é uma sequência\" sobre quatro itens\n  sem ordem nem progressão (I03);\n- as setas ↗/↘, convenção de link externo em itens que não levam a lugar\n  nenhum — o mesmo ícone que o ProjectCard usa num card que é clicável\n  (I04).\n\nAs duas colunas passam a ser proporcionais em vez de uma fixa de 525px,\nque entre 768px e 1279px deixava o título espremido.\n\nRefs: A02, A12, A14, I03, I04\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"badbf085ccac73d9bedd5ac22d9d5728aefb9b61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/badbf085ccac73d9bedd5ac22d9d5728aefb9b61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/f69135e8b00b1e7e7727567f8694621619b0f202","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/f69135e8b00b1e7e7727567f8694621619b0f202","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGY2OTEzNWU4YjAwYjFlN2U3NzI3NTY3Zjg2OTQ2MjE2MTliMGYyMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/d3d853fd54c9f4517a9ac56c1abdb8bf6ebe16f2","sha":"d3d853fd54c9f4517a9ac56c1abdb8bf6ebe16f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/d3d853fd54c9f4517a9ac56c1abdb8bf6ebe16f2"}],"sha":"f69135e8b00b1e7e7727567f8694621619b0f202","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/f69135e8b00b1e7e7727567f8694621619b0f202"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/d3d853fd54c9f4517a9ac56c1abdb8bf6ebe16f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:26:07Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:26:07Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs(audit): record Stage 1 as implemented\n\nMarca A01, A03, A04, A06, A07, A10, A11 e A13 com o hash do commit que\nos resolveu, e abre a seção \"Achados durante a implementação\" com seis\nregistros — entre eles o conflito entre A07 e A13, resolvido a favor de\nA07, e a correção de um número da própria auditoria (gray-400 sobre\nsecondary-900 é 6,24:1, não 5,79:1).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"d4d79061b26421784c4fbc8b4fb19a578dc572c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/d4d79061b26421784c4fbc8b4fb19a578dc572c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/d3d853fd54c9f4517a9ac56c1abdb8bf6ebe16f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/d3d853fd54c9f4517a9ac56c1abdb8bf6ebe16f2","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGQzZDg1M2ZkNTRjOWY0NTE3YTlhYzU2YzFhYmRiOGJmNmViZTE2ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/7ddd07b1fd3cb72b67d5a99e8dca8ec82145a0d2","sha":"7ddd07b1fd3cb72b67d5a99e8dca8ec82145a0d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/7ddd07b1fd3cb72b67d5a99e8dca8ec82145a0d2"}],"sha":"d3d853fd54c9f4517a9ac56c1abdb8bf6ebe16f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/d3d853fd54c9f4517a9ac56c1abdb8bf6ebe16f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/7ddd07b1fd3cb72b67d5a99e8dca8ec82145a0d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:24:08Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:24:08Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(navigation): track the visible section in the mobile menu\n\nO menu mobile guardava o último clique num `useState(\"/\")`. Começava num\nvalor que nenhum link casa, então nada aparecia marcado ao abrir, e\nficava desatualizado assim que a pessoa rolava a página — o desktop já\nacompanhava o scroll com `useActiveSection`.\n\nAgora os dois usam o mesmo hook, sem lógica duplicada. O `handleSelect`\nperde o parâmetro, porque só lhe restava fechar o painel.\n\nJunto vai o `aria-current` no link ativo, que o `Link` do desktop já\ndeclarava: sem ele o destaque existia só para quem enxerga, e marcar a\nseção atual só na cor seria criar uma inconsistência nova enquanto\ncorrijo outra.\n\nRefs: A11\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"40a9b79f1ebc8c0c4a0d48ba665280219bf3d75d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/40a9b79f1ebc8c0c4a0d48ba665280219bf3d75d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/7ddd07b1fd3cb72b67d5a99e8dca8ec82145a0d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/7ddd07b1fd3cb72b67d5a99e8dca8ec82145a0d2","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDdkZGQwN2IxZmQzY2I3MmI2N2Q1YTk5ZThkY2E4ZWM4MjE0NWEwZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/dc27a78d1a2a61a329397c59ad9eb04d0b053c95","sha":"dc27a78d1a2a61a329397c59ad9eb04d0b053c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/dc27a78d1a2a61a329397c59ad9eb04d0b053c95"}],"sha":"7ddd07b1fd3cb72b67d5a99e8dca8ec82145a0d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/7ddd07b1fd3cb72b67d5a99e8dca8ec82145a0d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/dc27a78d1a2a61a329397c59ad9eb04d0b053c95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:23:23Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:23:23Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"i18n: use one name per section in nav, heading and footer\n\nA mesma seção tinha três nomes. \"Expertise\" na nav virava \"My Expertise\"\nno título e \"SERVICES\" no rodapé; \"Projects\" na nav virava \"Case\nStudies\" no título. O nome de um destino é a sinalização de quem está se\nlocalizando: clicar em \"Projects\" e chegar em \"Case Studies\" faz a pessoa\nparar para confirmar que chegou no lugar certo.\n\nO rodapé ainda trazia um terceiro vocabulário em caixa alta — \"SERVIÇOS\",\n\"HABILIDADES\" —, resíduo de um posicionamento de freelance numa página\nque fala de contratação.\n\nAgora é um nome só, nos três lugares e nos dois idiomas, em sentence\ncase:\n\n  About me / Expertise / Stack / Case studies / Articles\n  Sobre mim / Expertise / Stack / Cases de estudo / Artigos\n\nRefs: A10\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"063d1a843e61308ef2c828053608130ee57bb908","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/063d1a843e61308ef2c828053608130ee57bb908"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/dc27a78d1a2a61a329397c59ad9eb04d0b053c95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/dc27a78d1a2a61a329397c59ad9eb04d0b053c95","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGRjMjdhNzhkMWEyYTYxYTMyOTM5N2M1OWFkOWViMDRkMGIwNTNjOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/1b92c41bb36d9d0140189df6b23066e4b71424d4","sha":"1b92c41bb36d9d0140189df6b23066e4b71424d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/1b92c41bb36d9d0140189df6b23066e4b71424d4"}],"sha":"dc27a78d1a2a61a329397c59ad9eb04d0b053c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/dc27a78d1a2a61a329397c59ad9eb04d0b053c95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/1b92c41bb36d9d0140189df6b23066e4b71424d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:22:23Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:22:23Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(services): drop the child hover rules that never fired\n\nTítulo e descrição usavam `hover:text-*` dentro de um card cujo hover\nestá no pai. `hover:` no filho só dispara com o ponteiro sobre o próprio\ntexto: passar pelo card mudava o fundo mas não o título, e atravessar o\ntítulo mudava o título mas não o fundo.\n\nO achado original sugeria converter para `group-hover:`. A decisão de\nA07 — hover reduzido a uma mudança sutil de fundo, porque o card não é\nclicável — torna a conversão contraditória: uma troca de cor de texto no\nhover é exatamente o realce que A07 tirou. Então as regras saem em vez de\nserem convertidas, e o card passa a ter um só retorno de hover, no pai.\n\nRefs: A13\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"6ee1f6499d1ce3796bdc0a67c170e2fb039d43cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/6ee1f6499d1ce3796bdc0a67c170e2fb039d43cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/1b92c41bb36d9d0140189df6b23066e4b71424d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/1b92c41bb36d9d0140189df6b23066e4b71424d4","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDFiOTJjNDFiYjM2ZDlkMDE0MDE4OWRmNmIyMzA2NmU0YjcxNDI0ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/81f24818ee4bc913c943e18920b83dfe205dd5b7","sha":"81f24818ee4bc913c943e18920b83dfe205dd5b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/81f24818ee4bc913c943e18920b83dfe205dd5b7"}],"sha":"1b92c41bb36d9d0140189df6b23066e4b71424d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/1b92c41bb36d9d0140189df6b23066e4b71424d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/81f24818ee4bc913c943e18920b83dfe205dd5b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:21:48Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:21:48Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(services): stop promising a click that never happens\n\nAs linhas da tabela e os cards tinham cursor-pointer, gradiente no hover,\ntranslação e sombra — todo o vocabulário visual de \"isto é clicável\".\nNenhum tem onClick, href ou tabIndex. A pessoa clicava e nada acontecia,\ne quem navega por teclado nem chegava lá, porque não havia nada focável.\n\nAgora o hover é só uma mudança sutil de fundo, igual nas duas telas. Os\nitens continuam não clicáveis — o que mudou é que agora eles parecem o\nque são.\n\nSaíram junto o realce de cor e de borda das células e a escala dos\nícones, que eram parte da mesma promessa.\n\nRefs: A07\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"7c634896885907dc9df255ddbd6750921d287763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/7c634896885907dc9df255ddbd6750921d287763"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/81f24818ee4bc913c943e18920b83dfe205dd5b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/81f24818ee4bc913c943e18920b83dfe205dd5b7","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDgxZjI0ODE4ZWU0YmM5MTNjOTQzZTE4OTIwYjgzZGZlMjA1ZGQ1Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/2a3c1196c4d41cd2c149f71112acd0e60dd98495","sha":"2a3c1196c4d41cd2c149f71112acd0e60dd98495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/2a3c1196c4d41cd2c149f71112acd0e60dd98495"}],"sha":"81f24818ee4bc913c943e18920b83dfe205dd5b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/81f24818ee4bc913c943e18920b83dfe205dd5b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/2a3c1196c4d41cd2c149f71112acd0e60dd98495/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:20:11Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:20:11Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(services): give each service a real heading\n\nO mesmo conteúdo tinha duas estruturas, ambas erradas. No desktop a\ntabela punha os títulos em `<td>`, então os quatro serviços não entravam\nna lista de títulos do leitor de tela — e navegar por títulos é o atalho\nprincipal de quem usa um. No mobile os cards usavam `<h2>`, o que os\ntornava irmãos da seção que os contém, achatando a hierarquia.\n\nAgora os dois usam `<h3>`, abaixo do `<h2>` da seção. O preflight do\nTailwind define `font-size: inherit` e `font-weight: inherit` para\nheading, então o desenho não muda em nenhuma das duas telas.\n\nRefs: A06\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"cfb253458e565641d467a43f5806d6af597d4def","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/cfb253458e565641d467a43f5806d6af597d4def"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/2a3c1196c4d41cd2c149f71112acd0e60dd98495","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/2a3c1196c4d41cd2c149f71112acd0e60dd98495","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDJhM2MxMTk2YzRkNDFjZDJjMTQ5ZjcxMTEyYWNkMGU2MGRkOTg0OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/bf1487ade6c401e8c4bc1b71213a6198222aa03e","sha":"bf1487ade6c401e8c4bc1b71213a6198222aa03e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/bf1487ade6c401e8c4bc1b71213a6198222aa03e"}],"sha":"2a3c1196c4d41cd2c149f71112acd0e60dd98495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/2a3c1196c4d41cd2c149f71112acd0e60dd98495"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/bf1487ade6c401e8c4bc1b71213a6198222aa03e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:19:24Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:19:24Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(navigation): keep the scroll position when the mobile menu opens\n\nAbrir o menu aplicava `position: fixed` no body sem salvar o `scrollY`.\nIsso tira o body do fluxo e o reposiciona na origem: quem estava lendo a\nseção de artigos, abriu o menu e fechou sem escolher nada, voltava para o\ntopo da página.\n\nAgora segue o mesmo desenho de `src/physics/gravity-world.ts`: guarda os\nvalores inline antes de travar e devolve na saída. `overflow` mais\n`touch-action` seguram o scroll — inclusive o de toque no iOS, que ignora\n`overflow: hidden` sozinho — sem mexer no fluxo, então não há posição a\nrestaurar.\n\nDois efeitos menores no mesmo bloco, apontados no achado:\n\n- a saída devolvia `auto` fixo em vez do valor anterior, o que apagava um\n  `overflow` que outra parte da página tivesse definido;\n- o efeito rodava na montagem mesmo com o menu fechado, escrevendo estilo\n  inline no body sem motivo.\n\nRefs: A03\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"110512d270f3c2dc6b0b44677fa9b32a1031c1f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/110512d270f3c2dc6b0b44677fa9b32a1031c1f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/bf1487ade6c401e8c4bc1b71213a6198222aa03e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/bf1487ade6c401e8c4bc1b71213a6198222aa03e","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGJmMTQ4N2FkZTZjNDAxZThjNGJjMWI3MTIxM2E2MTk4MjIyYWEwM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/caeee056241e36de4ee71e9d48e684c6c140f4b3","sha":"caeee056241e36de4ee71e9d48e684c6c140f4b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/caeee056241e36de4ee71e9d48e684c6c140f4b3"}],"sha":"bf1487ade6c401e8c4bc1b71213a6198222aa03e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/bf1487ade6c401e8c4bc1b71213a6198222aa03e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/caeee056241e36de4ee71e9d48e684c6c140f4b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:17:32Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:18:11Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(footer): raise the muted text to AA contrast\n\nO copyright e o link do modo gravidade usavam `#5F5F5F` escrito à mão\nsobre `secondary-900`: 2,48:1, quase metade do mínimo AA de 4,5:1. O\ntexto sumia em tela com brilho baixo ou sob sol, e o link da gravidade só\nficava legível depois do hover — invisível justamente para quem precisava\ndescobri-lo, e inalcançável por hover no touch.\n\n`gray-400` do tema dá 6,24:1 e evita criar mais um cinza.\n\nRefs: A04\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"f2f93a9728c11d7e78c994a3e42d91eb83ae8ccc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/f2f93a9728c11d7e78c994a3e42d91eb83ae8ccc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/caeee056241e36de4ee71e9d48e684c6c140f4b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/caeee056241e36de4ee71e9d48e684c6c140f4b3","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGNhZWVlMDU2MjQxZTM2ZGU0ZWU3MWU5ZDQ4ZTY4NGM2YzE0MGY0YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/b0e0742fb37ebb800b6342d5464e89f8d22c4340","sha":"b0e0742fb37ebb800b6342d5464e89f8d22c4340","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/b0e0742fb37ebb800b6342d5464e89f8d22c4340"}],"sha":"caeee056241e36de4ee71e9d48e684c6c140f4b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/caeee056241e36de4ee71e9d48e684c6c140f4b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/b0e0742fb37ebb800b6342d5464e89f8d22c4340/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:16:58Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:16:58Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(footer): make email and phone clickable\n\nO rodapé mostrava e-mail e telefone como texto puro, e o `<head>` ainda\ntrazia `format-detection: telephone=no`, que impede o iOS de transformar\no número em link. Numa página que existe para gerar contato, não havia um\núnico caminho de contato acionável — no celular, nem tocar para ligar.\n\nAgora a linha inteira é o link (o alvo de toque passa a ser a linha, não\na altura da fonte). O `tel:` recebe o E.164, que é o formato que ele e o\nschema.org aceitam; quem lê e quem ouve recebe `+55 92 99293-9794`, já\nque um número corrido é difícil de ler e pior de ouvir.\n\nRefs: A01\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"9f2e8d077c1095a6cbc6c00de7cccdc39bf4503a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/9f2e8d077c1095a6cbc6c00de7cccdc39bf4503a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/b0e0742fb37ebb800b6342d5464e89f8d22c4340","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/b0e0742fb37ebb800b6342d5464e89f8d22c4340","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGIwZTA3NDJmYjM3ZWJiODAwYjYzNDJkNTQ2NGU4OWY4ZDIyYzQzNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/724a75a8503e3b881ff60decaac66b58084583fe","sha":"724a75a8503e3b881ff60decaac66b58084583fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/724a75a8503e3b881ff60decaac66b58084583fe"}],"sha":"b0e0742fb37ebb800b6342d5464e89f8d22c4340","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/b0e0742fb37ebb800b6342d5464e89f8d22c4340"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/724a75a8503e3b881ff60decaac66b58084583fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:59:33Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:59:33Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(experience): make the layered stack read as an object, not paper\n\nA cena ficou ruim: as placas pareciam recortes de papelão. Medindo, o\nmotivo apareceu.\n\nA faixa de luminância do objeto era 0,160 — primary-700 na sombra e\nprimary-400 na luz, dois roxos médios. Sem variação entre sombra e luz\nnão há volume, e um objeto claro sobre o fundo branco da seção ainda por\ncima não se destacava.\n\nTrês mudanças, todas sobre material e não sobre forma:\n\n- arestas biseladas, via ExtrudeGeometry com cantos arredondados. Caixa\n  de canto vivo não tem onde a luz bater; o bisel cria a faixa estreita\n  que acende em cada quina, que é o que faz render de produto parecer\n  sólido.\n- faixa de valor 3,8x maior: sombra quase primary-900, brilho quase\n  branco.\n- especular Blinn-Phong e um fresnel estreito para o bisel acender. Era\n  o brilho que faltava para denunciar superfície dura.\n\nMenos placas e mais grossas, também: quatro se leem, sete viravam uma\npilha de folhas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"6f80aadba45495cf38eb440afe8b04fbe2d2fb4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/6f80aadba45495cf38eb440afe8b04fbe2d2fb4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/724a75a8503e3b881ff60decaac66b58084583fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/724a75a8503e3b881ff60decaac66b58084583fe","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDcyNGE3NWE4NTAzZTNiODgxZmY2MGRlY2FhYzY2YjU4MDg0NTgzZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/ab9e8f13bc96aa968ce69096057cf252bba175d0","sha":"ab9e8f13bc96aa968ce69096057cf252bba175d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/ab9e8f13bc96aa968ce69096057cf252bba175d0"}],"sha":"724a75a8503e3b881ff60decaac66b58084583fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/724a75a8503e3b881ff60decaac66b58084583fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/ab9e8f13bc96aa968ce69096057cf252bba175d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:54:21Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:54:21Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"content(articles): translate the unit testing article, and fix internal links\n\nTerceiro artigo traduzido. Os blocos de código foram preservados; o que\nmudou dentro deles foram os textos de interface e as mensagens, porque um\nteste que procura por /senha/i não faz sentido num artigo em inglês.\n\nNo caminho: todos os artigos tinham links entre si apontando para o\ncaminho do ARQUIVO .md, herdado de quando eram documentos soltos numa\npasta. No site isso nunca resolveu — eram 15 links mortos. Agora apontam\npara a rota do artigo, nos dois idiomas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"d1c8476c15cbd36da363756a93f42bf8bf75955f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/d1c8476c15cbd36da363756a93f42bf8bf75955f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/ab9e8f13bc96aa968ce69096057cf252bba175d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/ab9e8f13bc96aa968ce69096057cf252bba175d0","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGFiOWU4ZjEzYmM5NmFhOTY4Y2U2OTA5NjA1N2NmMjUyYmJhMTc1ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/4c2050ed22963f5f22602403e6a6ce4752f861c3","sha":"4c2050ed22963f5f22602403e6a6ce4752f861c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4c2050ed22963f5f22602403e6a6ce4752f861c3"}],"sha":"ab9e8f13bc96aa968ce69096057cf252bba175d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/ab9e8f13bc96aa968ce69096057cf252bba175d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4c2050ed22963f5f22602403e6a6ce4752f861c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:50:52Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:50:52Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(experience): lighten the hero and give \"about me\" a scene of its own\n\nDavy achou a home visualmente pesada, e olhando as telas ele tem razão\nem dois pontos concretos.\n\nOs anéis do hero tinham 26px de espessura num hero de 700px. Nessa\nescala eles deixam de ser fundo e viram um elemento gráfico disputando\ncom o retrato. Caíram para cerca de 10px, o núcleo encolheu pela metade\ne o rim saiu de 0.9 para 0.45 — era ele que dava o brilho de plástico.\n\nA seção \"Quem sou eu\" tinha uma ilustração genérica de banco de imagens,\nnum bloco roxo enorme que repetia a cor do hero e deixava a página\nmonocromática. Sai a imagem, entra uma cena: placas finas empilhadas e\nlevemente desalinhadas, que se afastam conforme a seção sobe.\n\nA leitura é a da própria seção — camadas separadas por baixo, uma\nsuperfície só por cima. É de propósito o oposto do hero: lá os anéis\nabrem e fecham, aqui nada acontece de repente. Some abaixo de lg, onde a\nseção empilha e a cena passaria atrás do texto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"6092ba97c5e08255399a747fe6b11409489519df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/6092ba97c5e08255399a747fe6b11409489519df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/4c2050ed22963f5f22602403e6a6ce4752f861c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/4c2050ed22963f5f22602403e6a6ce4752f861c3","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDRjMjA1MGVkMjI5NjNmNWYyMjYwMjQwM2U2YTZjZTQ3NTJmODYxYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/4001f3b9c9d301b41f4b41f9b05ca13ca431b37b","sha":"4001f3b9c9d301b41f4b41f9b05ca13ca431b37b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4001f3b9c9d301b41f4b41f9b05ca13ca431b37b"}],"sha":"4c2050ed22963f5f22602403e6a6ce4752f861c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4c2050ed22963f5f22602403e6a6ce4752f861c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4001f3b9c9d301b41f4b41f9b05ca13ca431b37b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:43:13Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:43:13Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(navigation): from an article, the navbar just goes home\n\nSair de um artigo pelo menu tentava alcançar a seção enquanto a home se\nmontava. Era a parte que dava errado de todo jeito, e o destino nem era\nesse: o pedido é ir para a home e parar por aí.\n\nA rolagem automática passa a existir para um caso só — alguém colar\ndavysz.com/#skills numa aba nova, onde as seções lazy fazem o navegador\ndesistir da âncora. O hash de abertura é congelado na montagem, então\nnavegação posterior nunca reativa o mecanismo.\n\nCom isso somem o listener de hashchange e o retorno do estado \"enabled\":\ndentro da home quem rola é o navegador, e vindo de um artigo o destino é\no topo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"7abfb36637462d2b0c24e712e6b31b8de227b983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/7abfb36637462d2b0c24e712e6b31b8de227b983"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/4001f3b9c9d301b41f4b41f9b05ca13ca431b37b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/4001f3b9c9d301b41f4b41f9b05ca13ca431b37b","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDQwMDFmM2I5YzlkMzAxYjQxZjRiNDFmOWIwNWNhMTNjYTQzMWIzN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/c1bc6db8ac5cc4e11913aba78d71665a1b9a60bf","sha":"c1bc6db8ac5cc4e11913aba78d71665a1b9a60bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c1bc6db8ac5cc4e11913aba78d71665a1b9a60bf"}],"sha":"4001f3b9c9d301b41f4b41f9b05ca13ca431b37b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4001f3b9c9d301b41f4b41f9b05ca13ca431b37b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c1bc6db8ac5cc4e11913aba78d71665a1b9a60bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:39:02Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:39:02Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(articles): keep the route when jumping to a section of the article\n\nClicar num item de \"Nesta página\" levava para a home.\n\nO sumário gerava `href=\"#<id>\"`, um hash simples. Isso faz o hash deixar\nde começar com o prefixo da rota, então readSlug devolvia null, o artigo\ndesmontava e a home montava no lugar. As âncoras ao lado dos títulos\ntinham o mesmo problema.\n\nA âncora passa a viver DENTRO da rota: `#/artigos/<slug>/<heading>`. O\nlink continua real, copiável e compartilhável — que era justamente o\nmotivo de gerar id em cada título.\n\nPular entre seções do mesmo artigo deixa de ser tratado como troca de\npágina: sem voltar ao topo e sem animar a transição, porque não é uma\npágina nova, só um destino diferente dentro dela.\n\nAs âncoras dos títulos são reescritas em runtime, na própria página do\nartigo. O plugin continua gerando `#<id>`, que é o certo para um markdown\nsolto — o gerador de conteúdo não precisa saber de roteamento.\n\nDe quebra, `scroll-margin-top` passa a valer também para os títulos do\nartigo; sem isso o header sticky cobriria o título recém-alcançado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"d865b9faedf65fdf789e06eb0f758af2ee277e1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/d865b9faedf65fdf789e06eb0f758af2ee277e1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/c1bc6db8ac5cc4e11913aba78d71665a1b9a60bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/c1bc6db8ac5cc4e11913aba78d71665a1b9a60bf","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGMxYmM2ZGI4YWM1Y2M0ZTExOTEzYWJhNzhkNzE2NjVhMWI5YTYwYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/5e69fc69b26706e4ea8db988749c1960a3d2ec33","sha":"5e69fc69b26706e4ea8db988749c1960a3d2ec33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/5e69fc69b26706e4ea8db988749c1960a3d2ec33"}],"sha":"c1bc6db8ac5cc4e11913aba78d71665a1b9a60bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c1bc6db8ac5cc4e11913aba78d71665a1b9a60bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/5e69fc69b26706e4ea8db988749c1960a3d2ec33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:35:05Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:35:05Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(navigation): land on the section once, instead of chasing it\n\nSair de um artigo pelo menu levava para a home num estado estranho.\n\nEram duas coisas somadas. A rolagem começava da altura em que o artigo\nestava, que é um ponto arbitrário. E o realinhamento disparava a CADA\nmudança de altura do documento: enquanto as seções lazy chegavam, isso\nvirava uma sequência de saltos instantâneos, com a animação de transição\nrodando por cima.\n\nAgora é uma coisa só:\n\n- sair de um artigo volta ao topo, que é o único ponto de partida\n  previsível para o que vem depois\n- se a seção já existe, não fazemos nada — quem rola é o navegador, com\n  o scroll-behavior: smooth do CSS, que é a navegação de sempre dentro\n  da home\n- se não existe, espera a altura do documento ficar quieta por 150ms e\n  rola UMA vez\n\nSome o loop de requestAnimationFrame e o realinhamento contínuo, que era\na parte bugada.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"7826bc546cc87487bcedbf0d8e21a50aa0ebffdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/7826bc546cc87487bcedbf0d8e21a50aa0ebffdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/5e69fc69b26706e4ea8db988749c1960a3d2ec33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"