o/commits/66cda04cbd8beab33b69118c4636d83041f94e40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:31:05Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:31:05Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"content(articles): translate BFF and the exam-effect essay to English\n\nOs dois mais curtos primeiro, para validar o caminho inteiro: catálogo,\ncarregador por idioma, chunk separado e o aviso de fallback.\n\nTradução, não versão literal. O texto do ENEM depende de uma referência\nbrasileira, então a primeira menção explica o que é — sem isso o\nargumento não fecha para quem lê de fora. Os blocos de código ficaram\nintactos; só os comentários dentro deles foram traduzidos.\n\nFaltam seis artigos, 16 mil palavras. Até lá eles aparecem na lista em\ninglês e o corpo cai no português com aviso.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"5c566381526493b9d61e5e840f1b676f70e908a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/5c566381526493b9d61e5e840f1b676f70e908a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/66cda04cbd8beab33b69118c4636d83041f94e40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/66cda04cbd8beab33b69118c4636d83041f94e40","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDY2Y2RhMDRjYmQ4YmVhYjMzYjY5MTE4YzQ2MzZkODMwNDFmOTRlNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/a91e10fa16da55c8160aac72ec6bbb2681704f2b","sha":"a91e10fa16da55c8160aac72ec6bbb2681704f2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/a91e10fa16da55c8160aac72ec6bbb2681704f2b"}],"sha":"66cda04cbd8beab33b69118c4636d83041f94e40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/66cda04cbd8beab33b69118c4636d83041f94e40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/a91e10fa16da55c8160aac72ec6bbb2681704f2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:29:12Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:29:12Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(articles): support bilingual articles with an honest fallback\n\nPrepara os artigos para existirem nos dois idiomas, antes de traduzir os\ntextos em si.\n\nOs .md viram `<slug>.<lang>.md`, e o catálogo passa a guardar título,\nresumo e tag nos DOIS idiomas — isso já está feito para os oito. Ou seja,\na lista é bilíngue desde agora.\n\nO corpo é outra história: 18.435 palavras de prosa para traduzir. Em vez\nde esconder de quem navega em inglês o artigo que ainda não foi\ntraduzido, o leitor cai no português e avisa, num aviso visível. O\natributo lang segue o idioma REAL do texto, não o da interface, então\nleitor de tela e tradutor do navegador continuam certos no fallback.\n\nCada idioma vira um chunk próprio: abrir um artigo não baixa a outra\ntradução dele.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"52fc0bd56ad209a927f695e9b74fb04ecded3673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/52fc0bd56ad209a927f695e9b74fb04ecded3673"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/a91e10fa16da55c8160aac72ec6bbb2681704f2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organiza