ue importa é o gzip — 34 kB contra 56 kB da\nmesma arte rasterizada em WebP. Medi antes de decidir: manter vetor ficou\nmenor E continua nítido em qualquer tamanho.\n\nsrcset: cada bitmap agora sai em duas larguras. O card de artigo mostra a\nimagem com cerca de 400px numa grade de três colunas e recebia a versão\nde 1200px — 4× mais pixel do que a tela usa. O componente\nResponsiveImage concentra a regra e trata o caso do SVG, que escala\nsozinho e não leva srcset.\n\nDe quebra, o `fetchpriority` em minúsculas saiu do hero e virou a prop\n`priority` do componente, em um lugar só.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"2ff22dd4fffdba3fac8a2bff9d47a113f8e5c81c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/2ff22dd4fffdba3fac8a2bff9d47a113f8e5c81c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/cdd5e255ae71331f9c3dcf8149c35ea1b059cdac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavyS