e,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/6a5d572a03033ee58e2c29362b4ec761b52df289","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDZhNWQ1NzJhMDMwMzNlZTU4ZTJjMjkzNjJiNGVjNzYxYjUyZGYyODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/a98bc69dbe7ab8d8cc8c093f16f5936a92b10ab4","sha":"a98bc69dbe7ab8d8cc8c093f16f5936a92b10ab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/a98bc69dbe7ab8d8cc8c093f16f5936a92b10ab4"}],"sha":"6a5d572a03033ee58e2c29362b4ec761b52df289","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6a5d572a03033ee58e2c29362b4ec761b52df289"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/a98bc69dbe7ab8d8cc8c093f16f5936a92b10ab4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:48:35Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:48:35Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"refactor: fix naming, breakpoints, tokens and the service worker strategy\n\nBloco de manutenção da sabatina.\n\n- a pasta `toogle` estava escrita errada desde sempre; virou `toggle`.\n- quatro hooks eram .tsx sem uma linha de JSX, enquanto os mais novos já\n  eram .ts. Duas convenções convivendo; ficou só uma.\n- props de Loading e Text saíram de interface inline para types.ts, que\n  é o padrão dominante (11 de 19 componentes).\n- useMobile trocava a navegação em 769px enquanto o hero só vira linha\n  em 1280: entre os dois o site mostrava a navegação de desktop com o\n  hero empilhado, um estado que ninguém desenhou. Agora usa matchMedia\n  no mesmo breakpoint `xl` do Tailwind — e de quebra para de re-renderizar\n  a cada pixel arrastado, porque o navegador avisa só quando a condição\n  vira.\n- `maxWidth=\"764px\"` estava repetido como style inline em quatro seções.\n  Virou o token `max-w-section` no tema, e com isso o prop `maxWidth` do\n  Text ficou sem uso e saiu.\n\nService worker: navegação passa a ser network-first. Com cache-first, um\ndeploy novo continuava servindo o index.html velho, que aponta para\nchunks com hash que não existem mais — tela branca até hard refresh.\nAssets têm hash no nome e seguem cache-first, que é seguro e é o que\ndeixa a visita seguinte instantânea. Cache renomeado para v2 para\ninvalidar o que já foi guardado com a estratégia antiga.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"1634cc9226e76ae8bde2adf76834fac80f385f7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/1634cc9226e76ae8bde2adf76834fac80f385f7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/a98bc69dbe7ab8d8cc8c093f16f5936a92b10ab4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/a98bc69dbe7ab8d8cc8c093f16f5936a92b10ab4","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGE5OGJjNjlkYmU3YWI4ZDhjYzhjMDkzZjE2ZjU5MzZhOTJiMTBhYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/df9606dd743823fcdd45bec8348d7ad8d4ff4501","sha":"df9606dd743823fcdd45bec8348d7ad8d4ff4501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/df9606dd743823fcdd45bec8348d7ad8d4ff4501"}],"sha":"a98bc69dbe7ab8d8cc8c093f16f5936a92b10ab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/a98bc69dbe7ab8d8cc8c093f16f5936a92b10ab4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/df9606dd743823fcdd45bec8348d7ad8d4ff4501/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:45:32Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:45:32Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(content): generate sitemap and RSS, and give each article its own SEO\n\nO sitemap tinha UMA url, apontava para www.davysz.com enquanto o resto\ndo site usa davysz.com sem www, e o lastmod era de 2024. Nenhum dos oito\nartigos aparecia. RSS não existia — um blog técnico sem feed perde\njustamente o leitor recorrente.\n\nscripts/content/build-feeds.js lê o catálogo e gera os dois. Roda no\nprebuild, então o deploy nunca publica feed desatualizado. Lê o .ts por\nregex em vez de importar: o catálogo importa .webp, que só o Vite\nresolve, e subir um bundler para ler metadado não se paga.\n\nCada artigo passa a ter SEO próprio (título, descrição, imagem e tipo\narticle). Antes, todo link compartilhado mostrava o cartão da home —\noito artigos com a mesma imagem e o mesmo texto. Quando o artigo também\nestá no Medium, o canonical aponta para lá, para os dois não competirem\npelo mesmo conteúdo na busca.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"a2de47295f01781204f26d800e363b670afdafd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/a2de47295f01781204f26d800e363b670afdafd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/df9606dd743823fcdd45bec8348d7ad8d4ff4501","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/df9606dd743823fcdd45bec8348d7ad8d4ff4501","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGRmOTYwNmRkNzQzODIzZmNkZDQ1YmVjODM0OGQ3YWQ4ZDRmZjQ1MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/6ff20916f8c6068797b3c56dacb19392cc8ba1b5","sha":"6ff20916f8c6068797b3c56dacb19392cc8ba1b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6ff20916f8c6068797b3c56dacb19392cc8ba1b5"}],"sha":"df9606dd743823fcdd45bec8348d7ad8d4ff4501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/df9606dd743823fcdd45bec8348d7ad8d4ff4501"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6ff20916f8c6068797b3c56dacb19392cc8ba1b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:44:07Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:44:07Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(articles): add table of contents, reading progress and neighbours\n\nOs artigos têm 12 a 15 minutos e até 38 títulos, e não ofereciam nenhuma\nforma de se localizar dentro deles nem de continuar depois.\n\n- sumário fixo na lateral a partir de xl, com o título atual destacado\n  pelo mesmo IntersectionObserver do scroll-spy da home. Abaixo de xl ele\n  some: numa coluna estreita empurraria o texto para baixo da dobra em\n  troca de pouco.\n- barra de progresso no topo, calculada em requestAnimationFrame a partir\n  de um listener passivo. aria-hidden, porque é pista visual e não\n  informação.\n- próximo/anterior no fim. Antes o artigo terminava no vazio e o único\n  caminho era o botão \"Voltar\" lá no topo.\n- âncora copiável ao lado de cada h2/h3, visível no hover e no foco. Os\n  IDs já eram gerados desde o começo e não levavam a lugar nenhum.\n\nO plugin passa a devolver a árvore de títulos junto com o HTML, então o\nsumário não custa nada em runtime — sai pronto do build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"0f80323a880b205a34b5b6077827ef86fa1656fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/0f80323a880b205a34b5b6077827ef86fa1656fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/6ff20916f8c6068797b3c56dacb19392cc8ba1b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/6ff20916f8c6068797b3c56dacb19392cc8ba1b5","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDZmZjIwOTE2ZjhjNjA2ODc5N2IzYzU2ZGFjYjE5MzkyY2M4YmExYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/0f7cda9c26c89212ddd335faaf9404e1dfde89bd","sha":"0f7cda9c26c89212ddd335faaf9404e1dfde89bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/0f7cda9c26c89212ddd335faaf9404e1dfde89bd"}],"sha":"6ff20916f8c6068797b3c56dacb19392cc8ba1b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/6ff20916f8c6068797b3c56dacb19392cc8ba1b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/0f7cda9c26c89212ddd335faaf9404e1dfde89bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:41:47Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:41:47Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(navigation): sticky header with scroll-spy\n\nNuma página de sete seções mais artigos longos, a navegação sumia ao\nrolar e obrigava a voltar tudo para trocar de seção. Agora o header é\nsticky, com fundo translúcido e blur para o conteúdo não passar por\nbaixo dele.\n\nJunto veio o scroll-spy, que faltava: o menu de desktop não tinha estado\nativo nenhum e o do mobile só marcava no clique, sem acompanhar o\nscroll. useActiveSection usa IntersectionObserver com rootMargin que\nprivilegia o miolo da tela — sem isso duas seções visíveis disputariam o\ndestaque a cada pixel. Como as seções são lazy, o hook reobserva quando\nelas chegam.\n\nO link ativo ganha aria-current, peso e o sublinhado já aberto, então o\nestado não é comunicado só por cor.\n\nDuas coisas que o sticky exigiu e que valem por si:\n- `scroll-margin-top` nas seções, senão pular para uma âncora deixava o\n  título escondido atrás do header\n- saiu o `mb:px-[100px]` do nav, que não é breakpoint válido do Tailwind\n  e não gerava nada desde sempre\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"d2b4ba18bb70f9135faa12f593cd4630cc200a97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/d2b4ba18bb70f9135faa12f593cd4630cc200a97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/0f7cda9c26c89212ddd335faaf9404e1dfde89bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/0f7cda9c26c89212ddd335faaf9404e1dfde89bd","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDBmN2NkYTljMjZjODkyMTJkZGQzMzVmYWFmOTQwNGUxZGZkZTg5YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/eaa4e839a56cedeff79b95075e8ad2b77a5eb68d","sha":"eaa4e839a56cedeff79b95075e8ad2b77a5eb68d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/eaa4e839a56cedeff79b95075e8ad2b77a5eb68d"}],"sha":"0f7cda9c26c89212ddd335faaf9404e1dfde89bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/0f7cda9c26c89212ddd335faaf9404e1dfde89bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/eaa4e839a56cedeff79b95075e8ad2b77a5eb68d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:40:08Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:40:08Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"perf(images): convert every image to WebP, 8.6 MB down to 553 kB\n\nMaior ganho disponível no site, e o que mais destoava do argumento dele:\na home vendia \"alta criticidade\" e \"foco em performance\" carregando 8,6\nMB de imagem.\n\nQuatro dos \"SVGs\" não eram vetor: eram PNG em base64 embrulhado num\n<image>. Pior dos dois mundos — o base64 infla 33% e o conteúdo continua\nbitmap. quezzy-thumb sozinho tinha 2,7 MB para um card de 600px.\n\nscripts/images/optimize.js extrai o bitmap quando o SVG é só invólucro,\nredimensiona para a largura que a interface usa e grava WebP. SVG de\nvetor de verdade é copiado intacto — converter vetor em bitmap seria\nperder qualidade à toa. Os originais ficam em assets-src/images/, fora\ndo bundle e fora do git.\n\n  user.png            1403 kB →  36 kB   (-97%)  <- elemento LCP\n  quezzy-thumb.svg    2743 kB →  54 kB   (-98%)\n  rentx-thumb.svg     1856 kB →  65 kB   (-96%)\n  go-finances.svg     1615 kB →  30 kB   (-98%)\n  ------------------------------------------\n  total               8634 kB → 553 kB   (-94%)\n\nJunto: a imagem do self ganhou loading=lazy (120 kB abaixo da dobra sem\nele) e alt vazio por ser decorativa. Nos cards NÃO coloquei width/height\nporque o CSS já fixa altura e largura, e um par fixo mentiria sobre a\nproporção, que varia de imagem para imagem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"cfa1b4da9d920bf15d3afc19fb93ec3d1f1799c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/cfa1b4da9d920bf15d3afc19fb93ec3d1f1799c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/eaa4e839a56cedeff79b95075e8ad2b77a5eb68d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/eaa4e839a56cedeff79b95075e8ad2b77a5eb68d","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGVhYTRlODM5YTU2Y2VkZWZmNzliOTUwNzVlOGFkMmI3N2E1ZWI2OGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/08ce7502ce9070268cf7875ba8e4906fc9c63d63","sha":"08ce7502ce9070268cf7875ba8e4906fc9c63d63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/08ce7502ce9070268cf7875ba8e4906fc9c63d63"}],"sha":"eaa4e839a56cedeff79b95075e8ad2b77a5eb68d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/eaa4e839a56cedeff79b95075e8ad2b77a5eb68d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/08ce7502ce9070268cf7875ba8e4906fc9c63d63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:35:53Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:36:55Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(a11y): make the site usable by keyboard and screen reader\n\nPrimeiro bloco da sabatina. Oito achados, quase todos anteriores à série\nExperience.\n\nAcessibilidade:\n- o componente Link não tinha NENHUMA regra de foco, e os efeitos de\n  sublinhado e fundo respondiam só a hover. A navegação principal era\n  invisível para quem usa Tab. Ganhou focus-visible e group-focus-within.\n- nove botões só-com-ícone não tinham nome acessível: 3 sociais no hero,\n  4 no rodapé, abrir e fechar do menu mobile. Todos anunciavam só\n  \"botão\". O Button já repassava ...rest, então bastou passar aria-label.\n- o menu mobile não era um diálogo: sem aria-expanded, aria-controls,\n  role, Esc, nem saída da ordem de foco. Com ele fechado o Tab passeava\n  por links invisíveis. Agora é role=\"dialog\" com aria-modal, fecha no\n  Esc e usa `inert` quando fechado.\n- texto visível hardcoded em português num site que abre em inglês —\n  inclusive o skip link, primeira parada de quem navega por teclado.\n  Tudo foi para os locales.\n\nBugs:\n- Button tinha type=\"submit\" fixo. Sem formulário no site isso não\n  aparecia, mas no primeiro que existir qualquer botão submeteria.\n  Passa a ser \"button\" por padrão.\n- <html lang=\"pt-BR\"> num site que abre em inglês, e o lang nunca era\n  atualizado na troca de idioma. Agora segue o idioma real.\n- a escolha de idioma não persistia. Agora vai para localStorage, com o\n  idioma do navegador como segundo critério.\n\nUX e performance:\n- Projects e Skills mostravam esqueleto por 800ms e 600ms antes de\n  renderizar dados que já estavam em memória. Atraso puro, removido —\n  e com ele três componentes de esqueleto que ficaram sem uso, mais o\n  shimmer.\n- a fonte pedia 18 variantes do Poppins num link que bloqueia render;\n  o site usa 4 pesos e um itálico.\n- Math.random() no style do SkillCard mudava a cada re-render.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"3e2d6a5e3e3efd38c43abccee0376e6fb532cf94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/3e2d6a5e3e3efd38c43abccee0376e6fb532cf94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/08ce7502ce9070268cf7875ba8e4906fc9c63d63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/08ce7502ce9070268cf7875ba8e4906fc9c63d63","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDA4Y2U3NTAyY2U5MDcwMjY4Y2Y3ODc1YmE4ZTQ5MDZmYzljNjNkNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/57d875dd2c86587cc778ae1dbf121a45a5032c6b","sha":"57d875dd2c86587cc778ae1dbf121a45a5032c6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/57d875dd2c86587cc778ae1dbf121a45a5032c6b"}],"sha":"08ce7502ce9070268cf7875ba8e4906fc9c63d63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/08ce7502ce9070268cf7875ba8e4906fc9c63d63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/57d875dd2c86587cc778ae1dbf121a45a5032c6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:29:31Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:29:31Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"docs: add site-wide audit of bugs, a11y, UX, consistency and benchmark\n\nSabatina do site inteiro, não só da camada Experience. Cada achado foi\nverificado no código ou no build, com arquivo e linha.\n\n30 itens: 4 bugs, 9 de acessibilidade, 7 de UX, 6 de padronização, 4 de\nperformance e 10 de benchmark contra LPs de referência.\n\nOs mais graves:\n\n- o componente Link não tem nenhuma regra de foco, então a navegação\n  principal é invisível no teclado\n- nove botões só-com-ícone sem aria-label\n- <html lang=\"pt-BR\"> num site que abre em inglês, e o lang nunca é\n  atualizado ao trocar de idioma\n- type=\"submit\" fixo em todo Button\n- Projects e Skills mostram esqueleto por 800ms e 600ms antes de\n  renderizar dados que já estão em memória\n- a fonte pede 18 variantes do Poppins e o site usa 4 pesos\n\nE a incoerência que mais custa ao argumento do site: ele vende\nperformance e alta criticidade, e a home carrega 7,6 MB de imagem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"ee33cb6ac7573cf67fe521e5bcc89d9a7cf32817","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/ee33cb6ac7573cf67fe521e5bcc89d9a7cf32817"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/57d875dd2c86587cc778ae1dbf121a45a5032c6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.g