users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/d859195590d6f1424e9632609b01efd79060c189/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:24:22Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:24:22Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(hero): pass fetchpriority in lowercase for React 18\n\nO React 18 não reconhece a prop camelCase `fetchPriority` — só a 19\npassa a reconhecer — e avisava no console que o atributo não chegaria ao\nDOM. Os tipos do @types/react 18 já declaram a prop, então o typecheck\naprovava e o problema só aparecia em runtime.\n\nEm minúsculas o React repassa o atributo direto para o DOM, que é o que\no navegador lê. Vai por spread porque o nome minúsculo não está nos\ntipos de <img>.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"32f17766daeea1c101292c9625378c046afe442f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/32f17766daeea1c101292c9625378c046afe442f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/d859195590d6f1424e9632609b01efd79060c189","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/d859195590d6f1424e9632609b01efd79060c189","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGQ4NTkxOTU1OTBkNmYxNDI0ZTk2MzI2MDliMDFlZmQ3OTA2MGMxODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/b6faf8d7615dc6c9e5795dd08cf0db685aff584c","sha":"b6faf8d7615dc6c9e5795dd08cf0db685aff584c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/b6faf8d7615dc6c9e5795dd08cf0db685aff584c"}],"sha":"d859195590d6f1424e9632609b01efd79060c189","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/d859195590d6f1424e9632609b01efd79060c189"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/b6faf8d7615dc6c9e5795dd08cf0db685aff584c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:22:01Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:22:01Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"chore(experience): final audit report and small accessibility fixes\n\nFecha a série. docs/experience/REPORT.md compara o estado atual com o\nBASELINE, registra o que foi corrigido e o que ficou para depois.\n\nNúmeros: o JS do caminho inicial cresceu 2.302 B (+2,98%) depois de sete\ntasks, um motor 3D, um motor de física e um leitor de artigos. three\n(245 kB), Rapier (796 kB) e os artigos (87 kB) ficam todos fora dele.\n\nCorrigido aqui, por ser pequeno:\n\n- a home tinha SEIS <h1>. Agora só o hero; seções viram h2 e cards h3.\n  O tamanho vem do `variant`, então nada mudou visualmente.\n- ProjectCard e SkillCard eram div com onClick: não alcançáveis por\n  teclado, não anunciados como link, sem abrir em nova aba. Viraram\n  âncoras de verdade.\n- `font-regular` não existe no Tailwind e estava em 4 variantes do Text,\n  gerando zero CSS. Virou font-normal. Era classe morta dentro de uma\n  string, onde a limpeza de código morto não alcança.\n- imagem do hero ganhou width/height, fetchPriority e decoding: é o\n  elemento LCP e não reservava a própria caixa.\n- *.tsbuildinfo saiu do índice e entrou no .gitignore.\n\nContraste medido em 15 pontos sobre as cenas: todos passam AA.\n\nMetade da auditoria exige navegador e NÃO pôde ser executada: Lighthouse,\nheap, renderer.info, axe e a matriz de ambientes. Nada foi dado como\naprovado sem medição — tudo isso está como checklist no relatório. A\nlacuna mais séria é que o BASELINE nunca teve números de Lighthouse,\nentão o orçamento de LCP/TBT do README não pôde ser verificado em\nnenhuma task da série.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"97050efb0e9dffd236037cbbc9106e39925905ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/97050efb0e9dffd236037cbbc9106e39925905ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/b6faf8d7615dc6c9e5795dd08cf0db685aff584c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/b6faf8d7615dc6c9e5795dd08cf0db685aff584c","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGI2ZmFmOGQ3NjE1ZGM2YzllNTc5NWRkMDhjZjBkYjY4NWFmZjU4NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/57687eac7655d77a1b1e26c28fc6116c7f4f2831","sha":"57687eac7655d77a1b1e26c28fc6116c7f4f2831","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/57687eac7655d77a1b1e26c28fc6116c7f4f2831"}],"sha":"b6faf8d7615dc6c9e5795dd08cf0db685aff584c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/b6faf8d7615dc6c9e5795dd08cf0db685aff584c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/57687eac7655d77a1b1e26c28fc6116c7f4f2831/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:12:01Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:12:01Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(navigation): stop overriding the CSS smooth scroll\n\nAo reescrever o hook para tratar o deslocamento das seções lazy, perdi a\nguarda que só assumia o scroll quando era preciso esperar. Com isso toda\nnavegação por âncora virava salto seco: o `scroll-behavior: smooth` do\nCSS continuava lá, mas o scrollIntoView instantâneo passava por cima\ndele.\n\nVolta a regra: se a seção já existe no DOM, não fazemos nada e quem rola\né o navegador, com o smooth de sempre. Só assumimos quando o elemento\nainda não chegou — vindo de um artigo ou por link direto — e nesse caso\no salto instantâneo é o certo, porque a página ainda está montando.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"5a06f638e8db760e6380b5ba98d1c4188036e4dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/5a06f638e8db760e6380b5ba98d1c4188036e4dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/57687eac7655d77a1b1e26c28fc6116c7f4f2831","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/57687eac7655d77a1b1e26c28fc6116c7f4f2831","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDU3Njg3ZWFjNzY1NWQ3N2ExYjFlMjZjMjhmYzYxMTZjN2Y0ZjI4MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/bee0dcc6d1da3f8c9066937cbb195f612786f220","sha":"bee0dcc6d1da3f8c9066937cbb195f612786f220","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/bee0dcc6d1da3f8c9066937cbb195f612786f220"}],"sha":"57687eac7655d77a1b1e26c28fc6116c7f4f2831","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/57687eac7655d77a1b1e26c28fc6116c7f4f2831"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/bee0dcc6d1da3f8c9066937cbb195f612786f220/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:06:54Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:06:54Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(navigation): keep the anchor aligned while the page settles\n\n/#skills continuava parando no lugar errado. Rolar assim que o elemento\naparece não bastava: as seções ACIMA do alvo também são lazy, e o\nfallback do Suspense tem 200px contra cerca de 800px da seção real.\nSelf e Services carregavam depois e empurravam #skills mais de mil\npixels para baixo, deixando a pessoa olhando para outra seção.\n\nAgora, além de esperar o elemento existir, um ResizeObserver no body\nrealinha o alvo a cada mudança de altura e para quando o layout fica\nquieto por 300ms, com teto de 4s. Se a pessoa rolar, tocar ou usar o\nteclado nesse meio tempo, a intenção dela vence e paramos na hora — não\nfaz sentido disputar o scroll com quem está lendo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"eef3fdb37729d06f71074d61547aea04e1586b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/eef3fdb37729d06f71074d61547aea04e1586b15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/bee0dcc6d1da3f8c9066937cbb195f612786f220","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/bee0dcc6d1da3f8c9066937cbb195f612786f220","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKGJlZTBkY2M2ZDFkYTNmOGM5MDY2OTM3Y2JiMTk1ZjYxMjc4NmYyMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/700fe9b629ee983058205c7f32771e998104b95d","sha":"700fe9b629ee983058205c7f32771e998104b95d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/700fe9b629ee983058205c7f32771e998104b95d"}],"sha":"bee0dcc6d1da3f8c9066937cbb195f612786f220","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/bee0dcc6d1da3f8c9066937cbb195f612786f220"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/700fe9b629ee983058205c7f32771e998104b95d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:03:53Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:03:53Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(navigation): scroll to the section when coming from an article\n\nClicar em \"Projects\" (ou qualquer item do menu) estando num artigo\nvoltava para a home mas parava no topo, sem ir até a seção.\n\nAs seções da home são lazy: quando o hash muda, o navegador tenta rolar\naté #projects antes de o elemento existir no DOM, não encontra e desiste.\nO mesmo valia para link direto do tipo /#skills, onde a seção chega\ndepois do primeiro paint — esse caso já estava quebrado antes dos\nartigos.\n\nuseAnchorScroll espera o elemento aparecer e então rola, com teto de 3s\npara não ficar tentando num hash inexistente. Só assume o scroll quando\nfoi preciso esperar: se o elemento já estava lá, o próprio navegador\ntratou a âncora. E nesse caso rola instantâneo, porque um scroll suave\nvindo de um artigo atravessaria a página inteira.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"537e5555caf357c0ba79958798a45b828ac15a83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/537e5555caf357c0ba79958798a45b828ac15a83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/700fe9b629ee983058205c7f32771e998104b95d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/700fe9b629ee983058205c7f32771e998104b95d","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDcwMGZlOWI2MjllZTk4MzA1ODIwNWM3ZjMyNzcxZTk5ODEwNGI5NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/4a4ad602ae2519dc1f0c78541569e11f438ee73f","sha":"4a4ad602ae2519dc1f0c78541569e11f438ee73f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4a4ad602ae2519dc1f0c78541569e11f438ee73f"}],"sha":"700fe9b629ee983058205c7f32771e998104b95d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/700fe9b629ee983058205c7f32771e998104b95d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4a4ad602ae2519dc1f0c78541569e11f438ee73f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T13:59:44Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T13:59:44Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"fix(articles): make code blocks actually render, and improve them\n\nOs blocos de código apareciam sem nenhum estilo: texto monoespaçado em\nfundo branco, sem destaque de sintaxe.\n\nCausa: as regras estavam dentro de @layer utilities, e o Tailwind poda o\nque está num @layer e não encontra no `content`. `.article-code` só\naparece em plugins/markdown.ts e os `hljs-*` são emitidos pelo\nhighlight.js durante o build — nenhum dos dois existe em arquivo que o\nTailwind varra, então acrescentar glob não resolveria. As regras saíram\ndo @layer.\n\nNo caminho apareceu um segundo problema: `text-label-md`/`text-label-lg`\nnão existem no tema. A escala `label-*` só vivia no objeto `typography`,\nque era código morto e foi removido; o tailwind.config nunca a teve. Em\n`@apply` isso quebra o build, mas em className falha em SILÊNCIO — foi\no que aconteceu em dois pontos que eu tinha escrito. Troquei pelos\ntokens equivalentes de mesmo tamanho (body-sm e body-xs) em vez de\nestender o tema por conta própria.\n\nMelhorias na apresentação:\n- cada bloco vira <figure> com barra mostrando a linguagem (TypeScript,\n  TSX, JSON…), e a rolagem horizontal fica contida no bloco\n- botão de copiar na barra, injetado pela página do artigo e removido na\n  limpeza do efeito\n- tab-size 2 e barra de rolagem discreta no tom do bloco\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"10167c72ab1e0a0e31ff2f3af579cc3afb761db2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/10167c72ab1e0a0e31ff2f3af579cc3afb761db2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/4a4ad602ae2519dc1f0c78541569e11f438ee73f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/4a4ad602ae2519dc1f0c78541569e11f438ee73f","node_id":"C_kwDOM7o7HNoAKDRhNGFkNjAyYWUyNTE5ZGMxZjBjNzg1NDE1NjllMTFmNDM4ZWU3M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/c7fe24b41e462c0359c4e40760b50de0deb7c39e","sha":"c7fe24b41e462c0359c4e40760b50de0deb7c39e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c7fe24b41e462c0359c4e40760b50de0deb7c39e"}],"sha":"4a4ad602ae2519dc1f0c78541569e11f438ee73f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/4a4ad602ae2519dc1f0c78541569e11f438ee73f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/commits/c7fe24b41e462c0359c4e40760b50de0deb7c39e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T13:53:45Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T13:53:45Z","email":"davydesouzabar@gmail.com","name":"Davy Assunção"},"message":"feat(articles): read the articles on the site instead of only on Medium\n\nOs 8 artigos passam a viver no repositório e a ser lidos no próprio\nportfólio, em #/artigos/<slug>. Os 4 que também estão publicados no\nMedium continuam linkando para lá, agora como referência secundária.\n\nMarkdown vira HTML em tempo de build, num plugin do Vite: marked e\nhighlight.js são devDependencies e nada de markdown chega ao site. O\ndestaque de sintaxe usa classes em vez de estilo inline, então o tema\npesa uma vez no CSS em vez de repetir em cada um dos 1.334 tokens de um\nartigo. Cada .md vira um chunk próprio: abrir um não baixa os outros\nsete.\n\nA rota é por hash. O servidor de deploy ainda não foi definido, e hash\nfaz um link direto para um artigo funcionar em qualquer hospedagem\nestática, sem rewrite para o index.html.\n\nAcessibilidade: o card inteiro é um link (nada de onClick em div), os\nheadings do markdown viram h2/h3 sem saltar nível abaixo do h1 da\npágina, links externos levam rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" e o corpo do\nartigo marca lang=\"pt-BR\", já que a interface abre em inglês mas os\ntextos são em português.\n\nA seção de artigos agora lista os 8 em vez de 4, e os que não têm thumb\nrecebem uma capa tipográfica na paleta da marca.\n\nCusto no caminho inicial: +428 B de JS e +512 B de CSS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"be5d1e59ff7a70e9cd418d85bbbc6d37705430a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/be5d1e59ff7a70e9cd418d85bbbc6d37705430a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/c7fe24b41e462c0359c4e40760b50de0deb7c39e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events