CLAUDE.md contradiziam decisões do Davy e fariam uma\nsessão futura desfazer o conteúdo atual do site:\n\n- idioma: o site é bilíngue e abre em inglês por decisão dele, não\n  pt-BR como estava escrito. A regra agora descreve o i18next e exige\n  que todo texto visível exista nos dois locales.\n- empregador: citar o nome da empresa está liberado. Estreitei a regra\n  em vez de removê-la — dados, endpoints, métricas, nomes de sistemas\n  internos e prints continuam proibidos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgQhDeQMp6pVDgP2yxx4Qk","tree":{"sha":"aadb8c3b791a4657937de0f085595112d7e6d984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/trees/aadb8c3b791a4657937de0f085595112d7e6d984"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DavySz/portfolio/git/commits/dcf502323fa382e0c93faebc77f6143cbcf6b7d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71401422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz","id":71401422,"login":"DavySz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDAxNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavySz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DavySz/portfolio/commit/dcf502323fa382e0c93faeb