mitter":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:01:10Z","email":"klaas.schuijtemaker@ritense.com","name":"Klaas Schuijtemaker"},"message":"Migrate weather extension to PF4J + Angular Native Federation\n\nFrontend rebuilt with @angular-architects/native-federation (federation.config.js, bootstrap.ts, tsconfig.app/federation; webpack/ng-packagr removed). Config components use ReactiveFormsModule + plain HTML with view-encapsulated styles (plugin-form.styles.ts). Backend: WeatherPlugin/WeatherPluginFactory updated for Operaton + PF4J, javaParameters enabled so @PluginActionProperty binds by name; dead WeatherService and the old config/bpmn import tree removed. Generated build output (src/main/resources/public/, repository/) is now gitignored and untracked.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e40822da2d2ef5027d3d5cfde453ed3e1fcaf11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valtimo-platform/weather-extension/git/trees/5e40822da2d2ef5027d3d5cfde453ed3e1fcaf11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valtimo-platform/weather-extension/git/commits/354f1bebf5233d0eefab1d9e8a6ec880eddf6362","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94360980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Klaas-Ritense/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Klaas-Ritense/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Klaas-Ritense/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Klaas-Ritense/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Klaas-Ritense","id":94360980,"login":"Klaas-Ritense","node_id":"U_kgDOBZ_VlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Klaas-Ritense/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Klaas-Ritense/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Klaas-Ritense/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/K