b816ec46841ae96be55b38a0c6d7671dc351","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aadhilmsyed/ReadOn/commits/83f6b816ec46841ae96be55b38a0c6d7671dc351"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129043818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/haokaim-cmu-F25","id":129043818,"login":"haokaim-cmu-F25","node_id":"U_kgDOB7ENag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aadhilmsyed/ReadOn/commits/3089f742f89b3eb1b22fbde6f7eb3da3ce016448/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T06:30:55Z","email":"haokaim@andrew.cmu.edu","name":"Tyler Ma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T06:30:55Z","email":"haokaim@andrew.cmu.edu","name":"Tyler Ma"},"message":"Add dashboard feature: API Composition history + credits + home reshape\n\nIntroduces the dashboard feature as a standalone vertical slice that leaves\nthe four feature microservices untouched.\n\nNew microservice: microservices/dashboard-service\n  - Owns story CRUD across the 4 feature DBs and user-scoped credits\n    in a new `dashboard` DB\n  - Five pg pools (one per feature DB + one dashboard DB)\n  - /history/:feature (POST/GET/:storyId) and /credits/:userId (GET, recharge, charge)\n  - All mutations atomic so concurrent clicks cannot oversell credits\n\nAPI Composition pattern (orchestrators/dashboard/composition)\n  - getAggregatedHistory.ts fans out to 4 per-feature history clients via\n    Promise.allSettled; one feature outage degrades only its card\n  - clients/ directory has one file per downstream feature for visibility\n  - See docs/patterns/api-composition.md\n\nFeature-action orchestrator (orchestrators/features)\n  - Single entry point for home page button clicks\n  - Centralizes validation (title <=100, non-empty title+text), credit\n    deduction (10/feature, configurable), and dispatch to storyActions\n  - 402 InsufficientCreditsError surfaces as a Home page toast\n\nCredits\n  - Default balance 0; user must recharge before using any feature\n  - $1 = 100 credits mock charge; no payment provider\n  - Chakra Modal on dashboard Credit card for recharge flow\n\nFrontend reshape\n  - Home: title input (<=100) + text field, \"10 credits charged per service\"\n    subtitle, unauthenticated redirect to /auth, Read Aloud -> Audiobook\n  - Dashboard: top row Profile (left) + Credit (right, 2x); bottom row 4\n    equal-width history sub-cards; titles link back to / with prefill","tree":{"sha":"966904396ae76ff4e470f3eddc39803003e8f87a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aadhilmsyed/ReadOn/git/trees/966904396ae76ff4e470f3eddc39803003e8f87a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aadhilmsyed/ReadOn/git/commits/3089f742f89b3eb1b22fbde6f7eb3da3ce016448","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129043818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haokaim-cmu-F25/gists{/gis