installed via: npx shadcn@latest add @obsidian/{component-name}\n\nCo-authored-by: Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me>\n\n* Integrate ObsidianUI components across portfolio site\n\nInstall and wire up magnet-tabs, hover-img, flip-text, text-fill-animation,\nscroll-stack, masonry-grid, arrow-fill-button, rectangular-text-reveal,\napple-spotlight, and trading-card from the @obsidian registry.\n\n- Projects: magnetic filter tabs, hover preview list, trading card, CTA button\n- Hero: flip-text on surname\n- About→Projects: scroll-driven craft text fill section\n- Experience: scroll-stack highlights above timeline\n- Blog: hover preview strip and masonry post grid\n- Contact & projects: arrow-fill buttons\n- Philosophy quote: rectangular text reveal\n- Site-wide ⌘K spotlight navigation in layout and navbar\n\nCo-authored-by: Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"1aa9d5fa8db9acab4fa8e9f460ba42e03c058aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector-mendoza/portfolio/git/trees/1aa9d5fa8db9acab4fa8e9f460ba42e03c058aa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector-mendoza/portfolio/git/commits/f252e0918d5c04f2317865b097d721515842d042","verification":{"payload":"tree 1aa9d5fa8db9acab4fa8e9f460ba42e03c058aa2\nparent 3af7340f0e43c52c0130020262c91e86eb78917e\nauthor Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me> 1789931134 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789931134 +0000\n\nAdd ObsidianUI registry and integrate recommended components (#135)\n\n* Add ObsidianUI registry to shadcn components config\n\nConfigure @obsidian namespace pointing to obsidianui.dev so components\ncan be installed via: npx shadcn@latest add @obsidian/{component-name}\n\nCo-authored-by: Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me>\n\n* Integrate ObsidianUI components across portfolio site\n\nInstall and wire up magnet-tabs, hover-img, flip-text, text-fill-animation,\nscroll-stack, masonry-grid, arrow-fill-button, rectangular-text-reveal,\napple-spotlight, and trading-card from the @obsidian registry.\n\n- Projects: magnetic filter tabs, hover preview list, trading card, CTA button\n- Hero: flip-text on surname\n- About→Projects: scroll-driven craft text fill section\n- Experience: scroll-stack highlights above timeline\n- Blog: hover preview strip and masonry post grid\n- Contact & projects: arrow-fill buttons\n- Philosophy quote: rectangular text reveal\n- Site-wide ⌘K spotlight navigation in layout and navbar\n\nCo-authored-by: Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsC5+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6U8QAI7dJ5xtgB07yRTVTcmqdWlT\n5EORjnfjPkUKvoVa9gpP8XbCcViYpHUbTkVN6lN/9thiG5ThkAbjhF/+DX2ibcbV\nd3zHE8/IeCsuFtFPSdN4MMzRBhQW8WE0lqtU6Xt9viliawSKshHmar/PMp3GQyvV\nG12R7c+mM/XdWlwTSn8Ye5Q31v4il0M7KLsNYXpI7qZ8/7bXlozMtkPt7pRNwV0b\neg3NQkmHKoCvG2gqWA6PDkdlQxkB1DKqu6kZIXTODKGyO3G3ZqHYtSSGvUtXH3Ko\npIJvkVvczhbIZWb8k0jzhTlrN9cB5SxOdrxBAyIF3Q8LgrJrHeLhVsO74YpSH+/h\noaxy4ogBWnUyBI8cfwIjYKIJUviBNeT7v7ww3nTU4ivaadw0kjtaLGJSfVasQQ27\nDYfe21RMiwKuxYM+GH8Ea68aPZmXv+IocZJ04xiv7o+HBhIl+qF/SSwt+E/ZfWby\n4cJnleCbUzcKlCwHK3B7Qtf3uVPBSXtmkox13V2s4vhwpOlJpFi9fUcDBLtYyIXp\nDHPlvdC7p3pzZ4IDgfT7ztlMBqrLP62pCtFrAwsANkx5+BGL3u/G2rfK8mRumQdn\nCJNjESyxO3W7PcGRISKdwjTDbjQoO+he2c0UAnbIU9CpHpFLQQ9Z+Ntu7w2ayAS1\nhw8bMjWm1nYxTF6BAvbs\n=FFVe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T19:05:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXN