 <hey@hectormendoza.me>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9a89515f12ee65d31d2da85d8efcf3656084d9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector-mendoza/portfolio/git/trees/b9a89515f12ee65d31d2da85d8efcf3656084d9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector-mendoza/portfolio/git/commits/18f283632bfa65c5aa37bf576e93809a75153011","verification":{"payload":"tree b9a89515f12ee65d31d2da85d8efcf3656084d9f\nparent d5f03b6938ab80c327c8c8b92e1fde1055ca9fb2\nauthor Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me> 1789061244 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789061244 +0000\n\nApply Color Bears palette with dark/light theme variants (#128)\n\n* Apply Color Bears palette to portfolio theme\n\nRetheme the portfolio with the Obsidian Ink, Velvet Curfew, and Almond\nHearth palette: update CSS design tokens, ambient gradients, glass effects,\nbuttons, hero featured cards, and blog skeleton shimmer colors.\n\nCo-authored-by: Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me>\n\n* Add Almond Hearth light palette at /almond\n\nIntroduce a cream-background variant using the existing light-mode tokens,\nwith route-based theme switching, refined glass styles, and footer toggle\nbetween dark and almond versions.\n\nCo-authored-by: Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me>\n\n* Replace almond light mode with three dark palette variants\n\nAdd Velvet, Ember, and Noir dark themes as preview routes, with a footer\ntheme switcher and per-theme atmosphere, typography, and button styles.\nRemove the Almond Hearth light route.\n\nCo-authored-by: Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me>\n\n* Add light variants for all four Color Bears themes\n\nIntroduce /light routes for Obsidian, Velvet, Ember, and Noir with\nmatching light-mode tokens, atmosphere, and a footer switcher for both\ntheme family and dark/light mode.\n\nCo-authored-by: Hector Mendoza <hey@hectormendoza.me>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signatu